Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.00,0:01:16.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,《洛奇6： 永远的拳王》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.90,0:01:49.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对梅森·迪克逊而言这又是一次迅速的 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yet another quick knockout for Mason Dixon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.77,0:01:51.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,击倒性胜利 马马虎虎的一场比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} almost perfunctory.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.54,0:01:53.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拳击迷们的反应让他知道  他们不是那么满意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fans let him know how they feel about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.74,0:01:56.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把女人和小孩藏起来吧 场面可能会变得混乱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hide the women and children. This could get ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.91,0:02:01.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这群粉丝完全没有掩饰对这场比赛的不满\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This crowd does nothing to hide its anger over this latest debacle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.45,0:02:04.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,粉丝们都火到不行了 他们不想再经历这样乏味的比赛了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fans are mad as hell. They don't want to take it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.49,0:02:06.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们好像在怪优秀的拳击手迪克逊 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They seem to be blaming Dixon,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.14,0:02:07.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为这种选手走下坡的现象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a good fighter, for the decline...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.56,0:02:11.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不只是重量级拳击 而是整个拳击界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...not only of the heavyweight-division guys, but of the entire sport.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.99,0:02:13.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们甚至向不败的世界拳王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're actually pelting...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.59,0:02:17.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,扔冰块\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the undefeated heavyweight champion of the world with ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.33,0:02:21.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许这种打从心底的愤怒会促使 拳王迪克逊找一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe this angry, visceral reaction will pressure Dixon to fight someone...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.20,0:02:24.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,与自己实力相近的选手 以此换来 新的竞技气氛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...who can fight back for a change. If there's somebody out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.31,0:02:29.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,整个拳击运动都期盼着一位 能用他的激情震撼观众心灵的选手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All of boxing is hoping for a warrior who thrills us with his passion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.63,0:04:59.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时间过得太快了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time goes by too fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.89,0:05:03.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗 我觉得还不够快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah? Not fast enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.33,0:05:05.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你的孩子应该来的 - 没关系的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Your kid should've been here. - That's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.73,0:05:09.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不 有关系 - 孩子有时候有点忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, it ain't all right. - The kid gets a little busy sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.34,0:05:11.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不会忙成那个样子吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He don't get that busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.31,0:05:15.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们别在这谈了 好吗 你今晚会来吧 是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's not talk about it here, okay? You're coming tonight, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.64,0:05:19.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在工作 过去三年我一直在巡历\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm working. I took the tour the last three years.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.51,0:05:21.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道 但今晚是周年纪念啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know, but it's the anniversary.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.78,0:05:23.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 我答应你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine. You got my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.58,0:05:28.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很感激你的承诺 谢谢你 算我欠你一次 保利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I appreciate it, thank you. I owe you, Paulie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.62,0:06:02.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗伯特 怎么回事 你去哪了 你迟到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo, Robert. What's going on? Where have you been? You're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.59,0:06:07.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我不想真的知道你去哪了 听着 你的工作表现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I don't wanna hear this. Look, your job performance...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.43,0:06:10.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不足以掩盖你迟到这个事实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is nowhere near good enough to be pulling this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.56,0:06:13.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不在乎你老爸是谁 明白吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't give a damn who your father is. You understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.73,0:06:16.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 懂了的话现在就去工作 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All right. Now get out of here. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.17,0:06:17.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先生 谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.31,0:06:22.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗伯特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo, Robert. Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.74,0:06:24.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你好 洛奇 - 你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, Rocky. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.85,0:06:26.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 最近好吗 - 你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, how you doing? - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.21,0:06:27.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好吗 冠军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's up, champ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.88,0:06:29.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你在我没准备的时候找我 - 我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You caught me off guard. - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.75,0:06:31.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想在你变得太忙之前找你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanted to catch you before you got busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.85,0:06:33.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 楼上还有很多事要做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it gets busy up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.69,0:06:36.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 最近好吗 - 真的很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So how you doing? Yeah? - Real good. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.69,0:06:39.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 洛奇 - 你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yo, Rock! - Yeah, how you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.86,0:06:41.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 真的很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, real good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.66,0:06:44.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 你想出去喝杯咖啡吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, you wanna go out and get some coffee?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.43,0:06:46.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要迟到了 或许以后吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm kind of behind. Maybe later?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.63,0:06:49.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 那也行 你今晚要来餐厅一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. That'd be great. You ought to come by the restaurant tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.87,0:06:52.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以帮你煮点好吃的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can have something made special for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.47,0:06:56.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚不行 我有计划了 一群朋友聚在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tonight I can't. I got plans. A few of the guys get together.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.94,0:06:59.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我是不是做错什么了 - 你的意思是?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did I do something wrong? - What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.78,0:07:02.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不知道是什么意思...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I don't know exactly what I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.65,0:07:06.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我在想 我来到这里的时候 你总是不自在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but I just think, like, when I come here, you don't feel so comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.79,0:07:09.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然 我不想让你不自在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I certainly don't wanna do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.42,0:07:13.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你给我一个很大的阴影 - 一个很大的阴影？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, you throw a big shadow. - A big shadow?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.63,0:07:16.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在这里什么都做不了 罗伯特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not gonna get anything done down here, Robert.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.43,0:07:18.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 你不打算介绍我的话 我自己来 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, if you're not gonna introduce me,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.45,0:07:19.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好 我是 威廉·汤姆逊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will. Hi, I'm William Tomilson.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.97,0:07:22.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 你儿子很不幸为我工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How you doing? - Your son works for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.70,0:07:24.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这是一份好工作 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's a good job. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.57,0:07:27.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道吗 我已经对罗伯特说过二十次要见你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've told Robert about 20 times that I wanted to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.57,0:07:29.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真的很忙 这是件好事 是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're pretty busy, which isn't a bad thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.94,0:07:32.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 有些事情阻碍着 - 帮我们拍张照片吧 好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I get a little tied up. - Grab a shot, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.91,0:07:36.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可能再也没有这样的机会了 老战友们总是团结在一起的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I may not get this chance again. Old warhorses have to stick together.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.32,0:07:38.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 老战友们 是的 - 走着瞧吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The old horses, yeah. - I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.52,0:07:42.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 还好这不是你的左手 - 这个姿势让你受欢迎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good thing it's not your left. - This makes you popular with people.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.99,0:07:45.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 一 二 三 - 见到你太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- One, two, three. - Finally, we get to meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.09,0:07:48.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要干活了 能当面见你真的太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta get going. It was nice to meet you face to face.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.00,0:07:52.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好好照顾自己 罗伯特 我们晚些再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You take care of yourself. Robert, I'll see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.77,0:07:58.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要走了 我会改变今晚的计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta get going. I'll change my plans for tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.51,0:08:00.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那样就好 我很期待今晚见到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That'd be great. I'm looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.54,0:08:01.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 最近好吧 - 还好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How you doing? - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.14,0:08:03.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.11,0:08:07.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别让那些数字烦到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And do not let those numbers drive you crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.68,0:08:11.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 太晚啦 - 用橡皮擦把那些数字都抹掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Too late. - Use an eraser, get rid of all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.85,0:08:15.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 洛奇 - 伙计们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yo, Rock. - Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.46,0:08:17.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 洛奇 - 你最近好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, Rock. - Hey, how you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.97,0:08:33.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.65,0:08:43.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要10个10号的 你们要照顾好自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll be about 10 tenths. You guys take care, okay? You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.42,0:08:48.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稍后我会买这些试试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll try a few of these later on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.29,0:08:51.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这些烤起来很香 - 多少钱?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's good for baking. - How much?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.99,0:08:53.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 保罗 这个多少钱 - 58.40美金 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yo, Paul, what's the cost? - 58.40, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.13,0:08:56.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 从这里面扣吧 我相信你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, take it out of that. I trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.83,0:09:00.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 最近好吗 - 你太大方了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How you doing? - You're too generous.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.70,0:09:02.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.55,0:09:20.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们都好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How you guys doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.33,0:09:29.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,生意还好吧 伊莎贝尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How we doing, Isabel?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.60,0:09:32.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还可以 除了那正看圣经不给钱的家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, except for the freebie reading the Bible.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.17,0:09:34.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 没关系的 - 就因为你以前和他交过手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's okay. - Just because you fought him...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.77,0:09:37.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不代表你要养他一辈子 他现在都不像一个拳击手了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...don't mean you gotta feed him. He doesn't look like a fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.84,0:09:39.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯拜德·瑞高 还能当拳击手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spider Rico could hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.67,0:09:42.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 听着 你的肚子还好吗 - 还行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Listen, how's your stomach? - It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.44,0:09:44.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你不断地往你肚子上抹橄榄油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you keep rubbing olive oil on your stomach...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.91,0:09:46.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你生的孩子会很强壮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...your kid's gonna be born very strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.08,0:09:49.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好的 洛奇 随便你怎么说 - 不 我是认真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay, Rocky. Whatever you say. - No, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.82,0:09:55.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗 斯拜德 - 上帝保佑你 洛奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yo, how you doing, Spider? - God bless you, Rocky.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.62,0:09:56.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.16,0:10:04.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们都好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How you guys doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.00,0:10:09.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宙斯 你能帮今晚我来的儿子弄些特别的菜吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jose, can you make something special for my kid who's coming tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.04,0:10:11.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No problemo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.47,0:10:14.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 感激不尽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good. I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.31,0:10:19.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在场上走来走去 走来走去 然后互让\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back and forth, back and forth, give and take.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.41,0:10:22.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后我像猛兽一样向前冲把他摔到场角\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then I went in there like an animal and threw him into the corner...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.85,0:10:24.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把我全身的力量都使出来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and I unloaded everything I had.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.50,0:10:26.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,钩拳 钩拳 钩拳 往左往左往左\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hook, hook, hook, left, left, left.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.72,0:10:29.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然而克瑞特 他拚命地回击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But Creed, he kept busting me back pretty good...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.52,0:10:31.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一股巨大疼痛感涌上心头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and the agony began to pile up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.63,0:10:34.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后我听到了这一辈子 最动听的铃声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I heard the best sound that I ever heard in my life...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.10,0:10:36.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 比赛结束的铃声 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The bell. - That's right, the bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.90,0:10:40.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从来都没那么累过 我坐在场角\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ain't never been so tired, and I'm sitting in my corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.23,0:10:42.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在尝试思考怎样坚持打完最后一轮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm trying to figure out how to survive the last round...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.04,0:10:44.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当米奇靠过来 对着我的耳朵说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...when Mickey leans into my ear and says:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.04,0:10:48.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油 冲出去打那家伙一顿 你这废物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Come on, get out there and fight this guy hard, you bum.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.31,0:10:53.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一定要拿第一 一定 我说 如果我能的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta be first. You gotta be first." I said, "Yo, Mick, if I could...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.31,0:10:56.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我会的 - 我会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- "I would." - ...I would."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.25,0:10:57.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,故事讲完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The end.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.28,0:11:26.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对梅森·迪克逊而言这又是一次迅速的 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yet another quick knockout for Mason Dixon,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.02,0:11:27.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,击倒性胜利 马马虎虎的一场比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} almost perfunctory.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.65,0:11:30.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拳击迷们的反应让他知道 他们不是那么满意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fans let him know how they feel about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.48,0:11:32.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们甚至向不败的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're actually pelting...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.25,0:11:36.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,世界拳王冷言冷语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the undefeated heavyweight champion of the world with ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.90,0:11:45.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好 阿吉瑞安餐厅 是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Adrian's. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.73,0:11:50.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要我告诉他你不能来了 好的 我会告诉他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell him you can't make it? Yeah, I'll give him the message.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.47,0:11:55.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在我脑子里不断回荡着米奇的声音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just kept hearing Mickey's voice in my head over and over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.81,0:11:57.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我匍匐着身体 在此之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just dug down, and before you know it...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.88,0:12:01.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当时靠得很近 稍等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...it was toe to toe and it was... Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.25,0:12:05.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的儿子说他今晚不能来了 他说他要延期 好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your son said he can't make it. He said he'll take a rain check. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.90,0:12:20.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看这些鸟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at these birds.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.27,0:12:23.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它们象不象糖果 会飞的糖果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't these birds look like candy? Flying candy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.24,0:12:25.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小鸟 你想飞回家吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, birdie, you wanna fly me home?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.31,0:12:27.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要人陪你回家吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need somebody to walk you home?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.78,0:12:29.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不需要吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.94,0:12:33.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚上很冷 在生活里我们需要些欢笑声 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a cold night. We need a few laughs in our life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.34,0:12:34.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得呢 也许吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} What do you think? Maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.52,0:12:37.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许 也许？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe? Maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.68,0:12:40.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 让我们离开这里吧 好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Let's get out of here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.17,0:12:57.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那地方从去年起就没怎么改变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That place ain't changed much from last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.77,0:12:59.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看够了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are we done?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.84,0:13:02.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米克 最近好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, how you doing, Mick?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.91,0:13:06.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个牌匾正裂开 保利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That sign is falling apart, Paulie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.05,0:13:10.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,整个世界都在分裂 瞧瞧我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The whole world is falling apart. Look at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.55,0:13:12.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别乱说话 保利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't talk crazy, Paulie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.15,0:13:16.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道吗 如果你在某一个地方待久了 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I think if you live someplace long enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.21,0:13:18.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也会成为那个地方的一部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you are that place.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.03,0:13:21.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我又不是在讲那些大楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ain't no talking building.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.76,0:13:24.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走吧 天开始晚了 小洛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, it's getting late, Rocko.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.33,0:13:27.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那火车声弄到我头痛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I get a headache from this train.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.99,0:13:49.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我记得她站在那里的模样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I remember when she was standing there...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.02,0:13:53.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很紧张 也很害羞 带着淡淡的笑容\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...all nervous and shy, with this little smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.36,0:13:57.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我最想让她做的事是信任我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And all I wanted her to do was trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.90,0:14:02.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她做到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She did.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.94,0:14:06.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 她做到了 - 你好了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- She did. - You done?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.92,0:14:24.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们还要在这里待多久 - 不会太久的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How long are we staying here? - Not long.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.89,0:14:27.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们把这溜冰场给拆了 我真高兴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I'm glad they tore this ice rink down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.43,0:14:28.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.83,0:14:32.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你听到了吗 他们把溜冰场拆了 我很高兴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You heard me. I'm happy they tore it apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.27,0:14:40.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一次陪你妹妹滑这溜冰场的时候 当时我们在那边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First time I walked your sister across this ice, we was over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.91,0:14:44.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她很紧张 我当时也不知道怎么溜冰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was nervous, but I wasn't so great on the blades either.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.58,0:14:48.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冰最无聊 站在冰块上的人更无聊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ice is stupid. People standing on ice are more stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.85,0:14:53.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她就摔倒在那边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And over there, when she was falling...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.15,0:14:55.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我手扶着她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and my hand grabbed her...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.76,0:15:00.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从她的大衣中挽住她的手臂 我能感到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and I got her arm through that coat, I could feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.43,0:15:03.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一股电流\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Electric.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.70,0:15:06.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你和去年说的一样 小洛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said the same thing last year, Rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.43,0:15:08.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did I?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.87,0:15:11.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你最好让你的脑子发育一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you better develop your brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.24,0:15:13.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你是左撇子 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're left-handed. - Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.27,0:15:15.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 小洛 咱们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Rock. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.01,0:15:21.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们看完了 这地方没地方坐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're done. There's no place to sit down around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.98,0:15:23.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.45,0:15:27.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有关系 这儿让人沮丧 而且冷得要命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It ain't all right! It's depressing and freaking cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.52,0:15:30.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是怎么了 保利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the matter with you, Paulie?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.52,0:15:32.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你活在过去 小洛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're living backwards, Rocko!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.79,0:15:36.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把生活的调子调回现在吧 过去也不是太美好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Change the channel from yesterday! Yesterday wasn't so great!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.46,0:15:38.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这是对我而言的 - 不是对我而言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It was to me. - Not to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.73,0:15:43.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你对她那么好 你们过了段好日子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You treated her good. You had the good times.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.81,0:15:48.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我对她那么差 我不需要回想过去的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I treated her bad. I don't have to think about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.74,0:15:51.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她永远爱你 保利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She always loved you, Paulie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.22,0:15:59.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起 小洛 我不能再干这些事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, Rocko, I can't do this no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.33,0:17:13.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你需要点什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.89,0:17:16.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不不 我过去常常来这个地方坐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, I used to come down to this place a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.73,0:17:19.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是坐坐 问题不大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was just looking around. No big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.23,0:17:21.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要点喝的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I get you a drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.40,0:17:26.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好的 那来点酒吧 - 马上来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All right. Maybe just a short beer. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.65,0:17:37.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去 快去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.42,0:17:40.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 去 叫他付我们的下一轮的酒钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, go on. Get him to buy a round.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.42,0:17:42.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让他付我们的下一轮的酒钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get him to buy a round. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.69,0:17:45.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让他付 他有钱 他在花钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get him to... He's got it. He's spending money.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.73,0:17:50.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 我不是想了解你的私事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, I don't mean to cross the line or anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.10,0:17:54.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我听到些关于你妻子去世的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but I read about your wife's passing a few years back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.27,0:17:55.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 是女人才有的癌症\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it was woman cancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.00,0:17:58.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 我常常听到人说她是个好人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. I always heard she was a nice person.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.14,0:18:01.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 最好的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.61,0:18:04.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我认识你吗 - 我们在很久之前见过面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do I know you? - We met a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.48,0:18:06.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We did?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.75,0:18:09.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当我还是小孩子的时候 你送我回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I was a kid, you walked me home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.42,0:18:12.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我送你回家吗 - 叫我别再抽烟之类的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I did? - Told me to stop smoking and things.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.22,0:18:16.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别抽烟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop smoking...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.09,0:18:20.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是当年那个经常去阿唐米克的小玛丽吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you Little Marie that used to hang out at that Atomic Hoagie shop?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.79,0:18:22.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 说对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.26,0:18:25.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 我记起来了 我送过你回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, now I remember. I walked you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.80,0:18:29.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走到家门口的时候 你转过头来 对我说 去死吧 讨厌鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you got there, you turned around and said, "Screw you, creepo."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.84,0:18:32.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我没那样说吧 - 有 你有这样说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I didn't say that. - Yeah, you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.34,0:18:35.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你确定吗 - 特大侮辱会让人难忘的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You sure? - Great insults last a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.94,0:18:39.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你吗 真的是你吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo! Yo, is that you? Is that really you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.85,0:18:42.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你最近好吗 - 我觉得他想一个人喝酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How you doing? - I think he wants to drink alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.42,0:18:45.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊 那么给他想喝的 我又没有阻止你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, then give him his drink, then. I ain't stopping you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.59,0:18:49.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是怎么了 他是你的男人吗 不 不是 我不那么认为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that, your man or something? No, I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.86,0:18:55.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之 我和我的伙计们 刚好在这喝酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyway, me and my friends, we're right down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.36,0:18:58.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想你可以买我们下一轮 要喝的酒 就一轮酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think you could buy us a round? You got the money. Just one round.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.83,0:19:01.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.90,0:19:05.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在干什么 把我的手用力推开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing pushing my hand away like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.17,0:19:07.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你的名字是什么 - 安吉 你知道我的名字有什么用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's your name? - Angie. What do you wanna know for?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.74,0:19:10.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 别像个傻子跟着那个人 - 一傻子？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't be playing a fool for that guy. - A fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.88,0:19:12.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 一个傻子？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - A fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.25,0:19:15.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是傻子？ 你才是傻子 我才不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm the fool? You're the fool, not me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.38,0:19:18.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你误会了 你是傻子 我是一正常人 就和你一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got it twisted. You're the fool. I'm a person, just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.62,0:19:19.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你比我好不了多少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You aren't no better than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.71,0:19:22.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你现在是一贵客又如何 你什么都不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} You think you're a big shot now? You're nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.36,0:19:26.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你比我好不了多少 好不了多少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ain't no better than me. No better!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.83,0:19:29.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎来我们这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Glad you dropped in?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.30,0:19:31.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想这周围变了很多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think the neighborhood is changing a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.83,0:19:35.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 刚发生了什么 - 我也不知道 忘了它吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What was that all about? - I don't know. Forget about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.74,0:19:38.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我快要关门了 你想下班 我去点账吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna lock up, so if you wanna take off, I'll tally everything up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.14,0:19:40.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好的 谢谢 - 最近好吗 小洛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, thanks. - How you doing, Rock?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.94,0:19:42.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很好 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm good, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.08,0:19:47.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你住在这里吗 - 离这里有八个街区远的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You live around here? - About eight blocks from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.08,0:19:50.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,八个街区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eight blocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.09,0:19:53.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想搭顺风车吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need a lift?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.32,0:19:56.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.52,0:19:58.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你结过婚吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you ever get married?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.49,0:20:00.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 有吧 - 有吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, sort of. - Sort of?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.46,0:20:02.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是的 怎么说呢 他离开我了 - 那样就告吹了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, well, he took off. - Poof, just like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.13,0:20:05.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 那样就结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.70,0:20:08.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你有孩子的吧 - 是的 我有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You sort of have any kids? - Yeah, I got one kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.77,0:20:12.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗 我也是 我也是 是个很棒的男孩儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah? Me too. Me too. Wonderful boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.57,0:20:16.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,牛人 你是怎么了 不可以帮我们买一轮酒喝喝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, tough guy! What's the matter, you can't buy a round?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.41,0:20:18.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那女孩子刚刚对你这种蠢货那么好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The girl was being nice to your dumb ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.15,0:20:20.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你拿什么给予我们回报呢 蠢猪 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you doing with that pig?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.52,0:20:21.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得这样就可以侮辱我们了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think you can disrespect us?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.98,0:20:24.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 她只是个会嫉妒的婊子 - 来啊 过来啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- She ain't nothing but a jealous bitch! -  Come on back!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.25,0:20:27.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了 别听他们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, don't listen to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.19,0:20:30.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们两个都比我好不了多少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Both of youse, you ain't no better than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.39,0:20:33.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过来啊 你的头会被我踢破的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come over here, you'll get your head kicked in around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.83,0:20:37.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你这个酒鬼 笨杂种 - 你又不是什么贵客 瞧瞧你自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You punch-drunk, goofy bastard. - You ain't no big shot, look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.06,0:20:41.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你连送那头猪回去的车都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ain't even got a car to take that pig home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.70,0:20:46.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.54,0:20:48.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.18,0:20:53.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想干吗 别出去 没关系的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing? Don't get out. It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.78,0:20:59.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 小玛丽 有关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Little Marie. It ain't all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.76,0:21:06.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 呦 - 你问怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yo. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.73,0:21:08.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我告诉你 进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll tell you what. Get inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.86,0:21:11.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 进去 你进去 - 放开他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You get inside. Yeah, you. - Hey, leave him alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.07,0:21:13.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 伙计 - 看到了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yo, man! - See it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.47,0:21:15.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 看那里 看那里 - 是的 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You see that? You see that? - Yeah. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.84,0:21:18.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你想说些什么 - 对不起 对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do you say? - I'm sorry. I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.34,0:21:20.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去找份工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get a job!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.06,0:21:38.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个人道歉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That guy sends his apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.89,0:21:40.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.18,0:22:01.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马丁 马丁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Martin. Martin. Yo, Martin!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.39,0:22:08.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还有钥匙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see you still got your key.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.45,0:22:10.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 我有 你有时间谈谈吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I got a key. You got time to talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.06,0:22:13.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自从你们炒了我以后 我有很多时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got a lot of time since your people let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.93,0:22:16.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道你被开除与我无关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know I had nothing to do with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.40,0:22:17.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.60,0:22:21.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们一年前搬到这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, we moved in about a year ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.80,0:22:24.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 真的吗 - 是的 我们只是暂时住在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah? - Yeah, I mean, it's only temporary.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.30,0:22:27.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是的 我看得出来 - 我之后会看看住宅楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, I could see that. - I'm gonna look for an apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.37,0:22:28.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住宅楼都很不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apartments are nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.14,0:22:30.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 房子就是那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. It is what it is, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.04,0:22:32.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,房子就是那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it is what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.11,0:22:36.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以前这个地方很不错 这里可算历史悠久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This place used to be pretty nice. There's a lot of history around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.48,0:22:38.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是吗 - 譬如这条街的尽头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - Like down the street...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.18,0:22:39.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是一家叫哥伦比亚的搏击会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is the Cambria Fight Club.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.95,0:22:41.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过去人们叫它一桶血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They used to call it the Bucket of Blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.99,0:22:45.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那里我打过几次硬仗 无论如何 那里都有美好的回忆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I took some massive beatings there. But it was nice. Good memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.43,0:22:50.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听说过 这些建筑物有一百年或 一百五十年历史了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I heard these buildings are like, I don't know, 100, 150 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.66,0:22:55.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我也有一百五十岁 我会支离破碎的 但对建筑而言无所谓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I was 150 years old, I'd be falling apart too. So it's okay, building.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.90,0:22:57.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是灯留下来的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does that light work?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.30,0:22:59.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不 那是被烧毁的痕迹或其他弄的 - 是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, it's burnt out or something. Yeah. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.24,0:23:06.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 我很感谢你送我回来 那些小子打扰到你的话 抱歉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, thanks for the ride, and I'm sorry about those guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.81,0:23:10.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一些小伙子总是不动脑筋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some of those guys just got their brains on backwards and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.55,0:23:13.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他这么晚了 还在外面干什么 - 那是你的孩子吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's he doing out so late? - Is that your kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.59,0:23:15.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 希望他别在外面待太久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Wish he wouldn't stay out so late.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.02,0:23:18.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 真是惊人 - 是吗 为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Amazing. - Yeah, what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.43,0:23:21.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上次遇见你的时候 你只是一个黄毛丫头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last time I seen you, you was a kid...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.93,0:23:24.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而现在你有自己的孩子了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and now you officially got one of your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.26,0:23:25.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的很棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.53,0:23:29.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道吗 他和你有点像 他也有爱尔兰人的发色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, he sort of resembles you. He's got that big Irish hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.50,0:23:31.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 其实是另外一个孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it's the other one.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.24,0:23:37.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是吗 - 他父亲是牙买加人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah? - His father was from Jamaica.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.81,0:23:39.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,牙买加人 欧洲人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jamaica? European.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.18,0:23:44.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你认识你丈夫的时候在坐油轮吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was you on a cruise ship or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.75,0:23:46.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不 不是那样的 - 他的名字是?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, not really. - What's his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.85,0:23:51.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 小史 是史帝芬的缩写 - 有道理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Steps. Short for Stevenson. - Makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.99,0:23:58.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他对着我生气吗 还是我站的角度 看上去他在生气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does he look mad at me, or is it maybe the angle I'm standing at?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.33,0:24:00.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 他是个好孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. He's a good kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.13,0:24:03.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你想见见他吗 - 现在有点晚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You wanna meet him? - It's getting kind of late.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.74,0:24:07.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我有很多东西要忙 - 是 我了解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I got so many things to do. - Yeah, yeah, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.21,0:24:12.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再次谢谢你把我送回来 你给的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks again for the ride and everything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.18,0:24:15.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.88,0:24:18.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.48,0:24:22.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小史 过来 对你的朋友说声晚安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Steps, come on. Let's go. Say good night to your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.66,0:24:25.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么冷的天 你在外面又不戴帽子 干了些什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing out in the cold with no hat on?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.26,0:24:27.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你吃了吗 - 吃了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did you get something to eat? - Yeah, I already ate.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.79,0:24:29.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.56,0:24:31.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你有点晚了 知道吗 - 我可以自己照顾自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're late, you know. - I can take care of myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.73,0:24:34.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小玛丽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo, Little Marie!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.84,0:24:37.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不打算给你的孩子介绍我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ain't you gonna introduce me to your kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.97,0:24:40.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 小史 你好吗 - 有什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How you doing, Steps? - What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.37,0:24:42.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听好了 我有一间餐厅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, I got this place,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.53,0:24:45.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一间小小的食堂 离这儿不远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this restaurant, nice little eatery not too far from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.75,0:24:47.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么垃圾 是一餐巾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's all this junk? Got a tissue.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.88,0:24:51.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有时候觉得自己是一只袋鼠 满袋子的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes I feel like a kangaroo, all the stuff in my pocket, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.72,0:24:53.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是你的 我有张名片 在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here you go. I got a card, there it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.02,0:24:56.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,假如你有空的话 你们俩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if you ever get a chance, it'd be great...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.26,0:24:59.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都能来坐坐 吃吃东西多好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...if both of youse come down there and eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.26,0:25:05.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那样就好 是免费的 要不这样 我把卡片留在这里 这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'd be great, free. You know. Anyway, I'll leave it over there... Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.30,0:25:09.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会把它留在台阶上 小史\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll leave it on the steps. Steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.37,0:25:15.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迟点见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.18,0:25:19.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来 走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.58,0:25:23.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从你十岁开始 你知道什么对你来说是最好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've known what's best for you since you were 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.05,0:25:26.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从你独自一人进来以后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since you walked in here alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.05,0:25:29.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,钱可以买到很多东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got everything money can buy...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.69,0:25:31.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除了一样之外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...except what it can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.56,0:25:36.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是自尊 自尊是你走出去的理由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's pride. Pride is what got your ass out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.06,0:25:39.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,失败是让你回来的理由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Losing is what brung you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.50,0:25:46.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像你这样的人 他们要接受考验 需要一次挑战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But people like you, they need to be tested. Need a challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.44,0:25:48.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会有的 没有什么人能打败我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That ain't gonna happen. Ain't nothing out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.01,0:25:52.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总有人比你强 总有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's always somebody out there. Always.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.88,0:25:55.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当那个时刻来临 你找到站在你面前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When that time comes and you find something...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.31,0:25:57.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,屹立不倒的选手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...standing in front of you that ain't running...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.95,0:26:01.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一步也不会退后 朝你一直攻击 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that ain't backing up, hitting on you,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.17,0:26:03.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你累到连呼吸都困难了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} and you're too damn tired to breathe...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.69,0:26:06.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你找到那样的感觉就对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You find that situation on you, that's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.83,0:26:09.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是火焰下的考验\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because that's baptism under fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.43,0:26:14.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你熬过了 你就找到这个世界上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You get through that, you find the only kind of respect...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.30,0:26:15.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,值得你珍惜的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that matters in this damn world:
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.14,0:26:18.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自尊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Self-respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.84,0:26:23.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你 马丁 感激你这席话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, Martin. I appreciate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.88,0:26:25.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在 你想冠军为你做点什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, what can the champ do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.98,0:26:29.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给点我你赚的钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can give me some of that money you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.88,0:26:33.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你知道吗 我喜欢你 马丁 - 也没那么喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You know, I like you, Martin. - But not that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.55,0:26:36.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.33,0:26:42.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和小孩合照一张好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about a picture with the kid? All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.73,0:26:44.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.07,0:26:48.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 小子 紧握拳头 让你看上去更凶狠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, son, hold up your fist. Makes you look more hazardous.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.54,0:26:52.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你的 - 谢谢 洛奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There you go. - Thanks, Rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.97,0:26:54.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢慢吃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enjoy your meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.68,0:26:57.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他人很好吧 - 洛奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's a nice guy, isn't he? - Rocky?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.44,0:26:59.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 斯拜德刚下楼了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - Spider just went downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.75,0:27:02.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不知道那样好不好 - 他在那里干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't know if that's all right. - What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.38,0:27:04.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不知道 那是你朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. That's your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.76,0:27:12.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯拜德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo, Spider!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.36,0:27:15.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 让我来洗碗吧 这样我会好过些 - 别这样 你是我的客人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let me do some dishes. I feel better. - Come on. You're my guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.10,0:27:18.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 让我做些事吧 - 吃东西就行了 客人都是那样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let me do something. - Keep eating. Guests do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.76,0:27:21.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别让我和你再打一场 上次你只是走运了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't make me fight you again. Last time you got lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.63,0:27:23.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走运？ 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucky? Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.90,0:27:25.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上帝要我工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus wants me to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.21,0:27:28.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 洛奇 - 什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yo, Rocky. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.84,0:27:29.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有客人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.58,0:27:34.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别弄湿自己 好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't get too wet, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.72,0:27:37.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还好上帝没叫你烧菜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Glad Jesus didn't ask you to cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.92,0:27:45.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你留下卡片了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You kept the card.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.76,0:27:47.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 卡片留下了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I kept the card.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.76,0:27:50.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 快坐 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why don't you sit down? - Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.67,0:28:04.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为 你知道吗 我走进去 然后说早上好 用这个表情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because, you know what, I walk in there, I say good morning, I do this:
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.84,0:28:06.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚 又是关于拳击的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tonight, boxing once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.28,0:28:09.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两个打法完全不同的选手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two contrasting styles in almost every way.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.22,0:28:12.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能把电视调大声点吗 请调一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, can you turn this up? Turn this up, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.72,0:28:16.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁是永远的强者 如果两个不同时代的选手站在同一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who was the best of all time? If two athletes from different eras...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.29,0:28:19.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,擂台上 谁会取得最终胜利呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...could compete against one another, who would come out on top?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.63,0:28:23.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,同一规则下 同一拳套下 谁是最棒的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Given the same rules, using the same equipment, who was the greatest?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.60,0:28:25.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们把数据输入电脑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We feed our facts into the computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.60,0:28:28.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们称体重准备一决高下的同时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They weigh in on who they think will reign supreme...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.17,0:28:31.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杰出的体育专栏作家小组为您送上 专业评论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...while fielding the comments of our illustrious panel of sportswriters.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.08,0:28:38.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冠军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Champ!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.28,0:28:41.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 冠军 - 怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yo, champ! - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.91,0:28:44.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快来看看这无聊节目 他们在谈论你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come check out this trash they're talking about you, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.02,0:28:47.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你在说些什么 - 来看看 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What you talking about? - Come check this out. Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.25,0:28:50.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚 两个时代的重量级拳击世界冠军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tonight, the former two-time heavyweight champion...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.79,0:28:52.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从费城来的洛奇·巴尔博亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...from Philadelphia, Rocky Balboa.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.99,0:28:54.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 美国周刊的澈卡·庄逊 你怎么看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, Chuck Johnson, USA Today?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.13,0:28:57.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毫无疑问 洛奇·巴尔博亚在拳击运动不很\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no question that Rocky Balboa fought tougher fights...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.06,0:28:59.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完善的时代打出强悍的风格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...during a tougher era in boxing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.80,0:29:01.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,分析一下梅森的职业生涯就知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look at Mason Dixon in his career...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.80,0:29:04.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他基本上以消耗敌人体力为战术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...he's basically been spoon-fed his opponents.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.27,0:29:06.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在我心中 毫无疑问 洛奇不只是随随便便赢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No question in my mind. Not only does Rocky win...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.64,0:29:07.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他彻底击倒对手取得胜利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but he wins knockout.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.04,0:29:11.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.05,0:29:14.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后代\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Offspring.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.35,0:29:16.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伯纳德·费楠德斯 你怎么看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bernard Fernandez?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.55,0:29:18.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪克逊是他统治的拳击界的受害者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dixon is a victim of his own dominance.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.48,0:29:21.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他从来没经历过 需要倒下再爬起的比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's never been in real knockdown-dragout brawls.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.72,0:29:23.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他从不需要发挥真正实力 调整状态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He never had to dig down to rally back.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.96,0:29:25.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,假如他在和巴尔博亚一站中 发挥实力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he tries to dig down against Balboa...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.03,0:29:28.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会发现他的实力与对手相差甚远的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...he'll find he doesn't have a big enough shovel.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.63,0:29:31.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我显然支持巴尔博亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I clearly give it to Balboa.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.66,0:29:34.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说刚才怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened to you? What happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.07,0:29:37.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拳击历史专家 伯特·阮道夫·舒嘉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boxing historian Burt Randolph Sugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.64,0:29:40.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪克逊一直在和懦夫战斗 我们不知道他到底有多强\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dixon has fought cream puffs. We don't know what he's made of.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.01,0:29:43.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在他们都年轻的时候 要加入这个条件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But both in their primes, you gotta factor in...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.31,0:29:45.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪克逊的速度一流\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Dixon's unbelievable speed...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.38,0:29:48.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他冲劲十足的攻击足以抵挡巴尔博亚的攻击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...his slashing offense. He cuts Balboa to bits.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.18,0:29:51.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毫无疑问 迪克逊比较有希望赢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No doubt. Dixon wins all the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.32,0:29:56.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的分析到此结束 让我们一起来看看电脑分析的结果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's where our subjectivity ends. Let's see what the computer says.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.92,0:30:01.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪克逊向巴尔博亚猛攻 洛奇没有反击 巴尔博亚在吃拳头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dixon unloads on Balboa. Rocky has no answer. Balboa is eating jabs.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.73,0:30:04.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这是谁的时代 - 梅森的时代\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What time is it? - Mason time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.70,0:30:07.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这是谁的时代 - 梅森的时代\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What time is it? - Mason time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.50,0:30:09.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这是谁的时代 - 梅森的时代\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What time is it? - Mason time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.04,0:30:22.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在迪克逊完了 他在一直往后退 他快站不起来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now Dixon is done. He is reeling. He is almost out on his feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.68,0:30:25.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴尔博亚把场子弄得火爆起来 围着场边一直击打他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Balboa turning up the heat. Pounds him across the ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.38,0:30:29.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伙计 这次他选错对手了 相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boy, he's bit off more than he can chew this time. Believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.29,0:30:32.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊 致命的右钩拳 迪森倒下了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, a murderous right hook! And Dixon is out on his feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.03,0:30:36.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在他摔下地板的一刻 他失去了知觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is out cold as he crumbles to the canvas.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.36,0:30:40.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴尔博亚嬴得了这场比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it is Balboa who has won...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.70,0:30:44.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女士们 先生们 小洛奇 小洛奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ladies and gentlemen, Baby Rocky. Baby Rocky.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.01,0:30:52.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你喜欢那里的食物我很高兴 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm glad you liked the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.81,0:30:55.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你把那些东西加热后 会是一顿漂亮的早餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you heat that up, it's pretty good in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.72,0:30:58.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗 谢谢 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, thanks, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.72,0:31:01.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你孩子不错 我希望这样的音乐不会让你头痛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice kid. I hope this music ain't giving you a headache.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.27,0:31:02.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜欢怀旧的音乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like this old stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.59,0:31:04.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我 我喜欢 很不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I like it. It's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.19,0:31:07.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那样就好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, good. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.64,0:31:20.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得小史想要一份工作吗 在周末赚点钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo, you think Steps wants a job? Make a few bucks on the weekend?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.04,0:31:24.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自己赚钱是件好事 我孩子周末帮我工作 他存了些钱了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's good making your own G's. My kid stashed a few bucks doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.24,0:31:26.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你对我们为什么那么好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you being so nice?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.21,0:31:30.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道 我没非分之想 你知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want you to think nothing's off, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.58,0:31:33.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的妻子 他离开我了 但不是真的离开 你懂我的意思吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My wife, she's gone, but she ain't. You know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.92,0:31:36.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 其实我也不是在想那些 相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, I wasn't thinking that. Believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.19,0:31:38.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不是吗 那你在想什么 - 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No? Then what was you thinking? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.99,0:31:41.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你又没欠我什么 你想干吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That you don't owe us nothing. What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.59,0:31:43.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,耐心点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.50,0:31:44.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.53,0:31:49.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没欠你什么 但你为什么不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I don't owe you nothing, but why do you gotta...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.64,0:31:53.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欠些东西 去啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...owe something to get...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.24,0:31:55.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.78,0:32:05.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么不欠点东西以此得到点什么呢 我是说真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you gotta owe something to get something, you know? Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.99,0:32:11.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想和你的孩子出去一下 你觉得怎样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think hanging out with your kid would be nice. What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.89,0:32:14.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得那样不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think that'd be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.16,0:32:18.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 你人真好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good. That's very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.76,0:32:20.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你的来访\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm glad you come by.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.43,0:32:24.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看着你们吃得那么开心真好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was nice watching you eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.64,0:32:28.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你和你孩子感情真好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good company.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.48,0:32:34.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小玛丽 让那里光明点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo, Little Marie. Let there be light!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.09,0:32:47.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你喜欢狗吗 - 狗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You like dogs? - Dogs?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.33,0:32:51.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狗 这里是狗的世界 这里是他们存放\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dogs. This is like a dog pound. It's where they keep...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.47,0:32:57.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各种各样狗的地方 过去我常常来这里参观\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...a large variety of dogs. I used to come here all the time for sightseeing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.34,0:33:00.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但 你也知道 你在和狗交流的时候学到不少东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, you know, you learn a lot talking to dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.94,0:33:04.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 真的 你可以学到东西 所以 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Really, you do. - Yeah, man. So...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.58,0:33:07.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伙计 这个怎样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, man, how about this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.71,0:33:10.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它看上去不怎么友善 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He don't look too friendly, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.62,0:33:13.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伙计 就这只吧 小狗 你好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man, this is the one. Hey, boy, how you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.49,0:33:16.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这只怎么样 过来啊 小狗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, what about this one here? Come here, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.92,0:33:18.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 哪只 它？ - 是的 它挺好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who, him? - Yeah, why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.59,0:33:20.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 老兄 那是只丑狗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hell, no. That is one ugly dog, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.93,0:33:25.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道 这狗丑得可爱 你近看一下它的毛色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know, but it's kind of a cute ugly. If you look at it closely, the color...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.43,0:33:29.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看上去像旧家具 有点海盗宝箱的感觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...it looks like old furniture, like some kind of pirate-chest thing going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.44,0:33:31.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 你说得很好 伙计 年轻一点的那只怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, sure, man. Hey, so how about a young one?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.04,0:33:35.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小史 忘了那只吧 过来这里 我想你看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steps, forget him. Come over here. I want you to see something.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.71,0:33:40.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在 你注意到那只动物 躺在那儿在做什么吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, you notice what this animal is doing here? Lying in that position?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.25,0:33:41.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它什么也没做啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He ain't doing nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.65,0:33:44.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有 它做了很多事情 它没有花一点能量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, he's doing a lot. He ain't wasting no energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.55,0:33:45.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为它死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.99,0:33:54.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它没死 它的命还长着呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He ain't dead. There's a lot of good mileage left on that animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.06,0:33:59.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给它点好吃的 给它个伴 砰！它又充满力量了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good food, the addition of a couple of new friends, bingo, he's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.30,0:34:02.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你觉得叫它什么好呢 - 狗是你的 你取吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do you think is a good name? - It's your dog. You name him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.90,0:34:05.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 这只狗是我们一起养的 一人一半\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. It's, like, a community animal. Fifty-fifty.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.67,0:34:08.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 我不是很了解狗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I don't know much about no dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.31,0:34:09.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实也不是那么复杂的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it ain't that complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.11,0:34:13.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你养它 喂它 自然让它长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You pet him, you feed him, and nature takes its course.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.91,0:34:16.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也知道的 你不想为你的宠物取名字吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, so... Don't you wanna name an animal?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.92,0:34:20.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每个人至少为一个动物命名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every guy should at one time try to name an animal something.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.45,0:34:22.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不知道叫什么合适 睡包好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. Fleabag?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.69,0:34:27.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是个容易记得的名字 没创造性 但很不错的建议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's catchy. It ain't original, but it's pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.93,0:34:30.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得你可以来点青年人的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you could come up with, in your young brain...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.50,0:34:33.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比睡包说出来更好听的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...something better to throw out than Fleabag.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.33,0:34:36.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小爆头怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Punchy. How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.67,0:34:40.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 小爆头 - 好的 就叫小爆头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Punchy? - Yeah, Punchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.84,0:34:45.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我很喜欢这个名字 你知道吗 - 真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I like it, you know. - For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.05,0:34:51.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 真的 就叫小爆头 容易记 又容易写\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, for real. Punchy it is. It's easy to remember, it's not that hard to spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.45,0:34:54.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听一次 就记住了 小爆头 很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And once it's in your brain, you never forget it. Punchy. Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.02,0:34:57.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好的 伙计 - 叫得好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All right, man. - Good call.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.86,0:35:01.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 小爆头 你准备好出来了吗 我的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, Punchy. You ready to get bailed out, my friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.29,0:35:03.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.26,0:35:06.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道那是开玩笑的吧 对吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you know it was a joke, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.30,0:35:09.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 我知道 你很风趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I know. You're a very funny guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.87,0:35:45.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.47,0:35:48.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拳击迷们的反应让他知道 他们不是那么满意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fans let him know how they feel about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.77,0:35:51.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 离开一下 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Excuse me. - Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.65,0:35:55.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,粉丝们的反应可能会带来坏影响\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This could get ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.78,0:35:57.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 小洛 - 保利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Rock. -  Yo, Paulie.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.45,0:36:00.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们待儿会讨论那场奇怪的电视比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're gonna be talking about that fake Looney Tune fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.09,0:36:03.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伙计 我们快要送上 今天的特色菜了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, come on. We're about to serve today's special.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.99,0:36:07.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,墨西哥菜改改名字换成意大利菜 一点都不特别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Italian food cooked up by a bunch of Mexicans ain't so special.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.90,0:36:12.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我偷懒来看这个的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, I skipped work for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.40,0:36:19.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪来的丑狗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What an ugly dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.24,0:36:21.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它很可爱啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a cute dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.88,0:36:25.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 洛奇 - 什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, Rock. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.28,0:36:28.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想离开一下 你的奖状照片之类的东西很酷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna take off. That stuff back there is pretty cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.38,0:36:29.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你喜欢吗 - 是的 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, you like that? - Yeah, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.28,0:36:32.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 谢谢你 - 待会见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thanks, I appreciate it. - I'll catch you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.69,0:36:34.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.09,0:36:41.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那个犯罪分子是谁 - 他是个好孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who's the criminal? - He's a nice kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.46,0:36:43.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他穿得像流浪汉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He dresses like a bum.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.56,0:36:46.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他从人们装未洗衣服的篮子里出来 有够恭维的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coming from a human hamper, that's quite a compliment.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.60,0:36:49.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把值钱的银具收好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hide the silverware.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.27,0:36:50.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.77,0:36:53.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好 斯拜德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Spider.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.71,0:37:00.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是打晕过他一次的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Didn't you knock out that bum once?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.15,0:37:03.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别再讨论这个了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you give it a rest?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.53,0:37:16.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就为了看这个我上班要迟到了 让我歇口气看看吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna be late for work for this. Give me a break, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.06,0:37:19.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 就看几秒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Just for a few seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.00,0:37:23.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,1960年末 一场相似的比赛 在两个传奇人物中爆发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the late '60s, a simulated fight took place between two legends...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.40,0:37:25.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,穆海穆德·阿里 和 洛奇·马烯亚诺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Muhammad Ali and Rocky Marciano.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.97,0:37:29.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马烯亚诺退休已久 阿里不能够和他来场正式交战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marciano long retired, and Ali unable to fight legitimately...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.91,0:37:33.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为三年来 他的参军梦都遭拒绝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...for three years for having refused induction into the armed forces...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.45,0:37:36.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他急需钱来维持生活 便答应了一场所谓的梦幻比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...was in need of money, and agreed to the dream match...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.42,0:37:38.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比赛结果会由电脑决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...whose outcome would be decided by a computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.15,0:37:41.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自从洛奇·马烯亚诺赢那场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's almost 35 years since Rocky Marciano...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.55,0:37:43.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由电脑打分的比赛 已有三十五年了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...won the much-disputed computer decision...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.09,0:37:46.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们知道吗 其实没多大变化\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and guess what? Not much has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.96,0:37:49.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上周 洛奇·巴尔博亚嬴了一场毫无悬念的比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last week, Rocky Balboa won a decisive fight...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.33,0:37:52.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到了吗 那就是我跟你说的 卡通拳击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See? That's the cartoon fight I'm telling you about.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.53,0:37:54.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.17,0:37:55.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一记极好的拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A stunning knockout.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.80,0:37:58.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可要记住了 比赛场上毫无人性可言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep in mind, this is taking the human factor out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.64,0:38:00.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 电脑显示巴尔博亚 - 漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The computer says Balboa... - Beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.61,0:38:05.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会取得胜利 13秒完胜 下面是这次比赛的余波\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...would be triumphant, KO 13. And here's some of the fallout:
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.58,0:38:07.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个开始只是给人简单消遣的测试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What started as a simple form of entertainment...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.95,0:38:10.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经变成认为像巴尔博亚这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...has become a rallying cry for people who think...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.42,0:38:13.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,守旧打法的运动员可以取胜的人们的口号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...an old-school athlete like Balboa could actually be better.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.35,0:38:17.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,电脑技术创造了些不可能的事 那只是毫不负责任的表现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Computer technology has to create what isn't. That's just not responsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.26,0:38:19.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去看看医生吧 你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get therapy, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.39,0:38:21.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你认为巴尔博亚与迪克逊交战 结果会如何呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you think Balboa would have done against Dixon?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.09,0:38:25.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很难看 我个人认为 巴尔博亚 被过分高估了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Badly. Personally, I think Balboa was completely overrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.43,0:38:27.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在费城南部开了一家餐厅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He owns a restaurant in South Philly.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.43,0:38:29.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里有什么看点 被砸碎的鸡肉？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the specialty, pounded chicken?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.57,0:38:33.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总而言之 我会付钱看的 下一个话题 钠斯汽车联赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyway, I would have paid to see the fight. Next topic, NAS CAR...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.21,0:38:35.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,争议不断\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and the controversy that won't go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.27,0:38:37.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我们回到周日的赛场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go back to Sunday's race...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.84,0:38:39.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伙计 开心点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, hey, hey, cheer up.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.68,0:38:43.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可是免费宣传 别太在意 肉店叫我回去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's free advertisement. Come on. Meat house calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.23,0:38:55.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好 罗伯特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo, Robert.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.56,0:38:59.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么晚了 你还在外面干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing out so late?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.33,0:39:01.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我打电话给你了 但没人接\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tried calling, but nothing was picking up.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.07,0:39:04.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 有什么事吗 - 我只是经过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is something wrong? - I just wanted to come by...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.47,0:39:06.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 想见见你本人 - 想进去吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...and see you in person. -  Wanna come inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.64,0:39:09.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我只想听听你的意见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I just wanna get your opinion on something.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.08,0:39:11.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 什么意见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure. Opinion on what?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.71,0:39:14.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们说这附近你只会走一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, they say you only go around once, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.25,0:39:16.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是的 我听过 - 那么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, I've heard that. - Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.65,0:39:19.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想做点什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I think I wanna, like, do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.32,0:39:22.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 打一打\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Like what? - Fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.02,0:39:26.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也知道 不是很正规的 只是小打小闹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, nothing big. Small stuff, like locally. You know.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.53,0:39:31.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不觉得你有点老了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you think you're too, you know, old?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.90,0:39:33.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得因为过多几次生日就\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think you ought to stop trying things...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.00,0:39:36.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放弃尝试 我不是那样的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...because you had a few too many birthdays? I do not.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.64,0:39:38.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,街坊会觉得你有问题的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People will think you're crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.24,0:39:42.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真正疯狂的是与对手站在赛场上 然后说我准备好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's crazy about standing toe to toe saying, "I am," you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.41,0:39:43.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那只是你一厢情愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's just ego talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.48,0:39:48.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想向别人证明点什么 老爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you trying to prove to other people, Pop?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.15,0:39:51.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,证明？听着 我的思维模式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prove? Listen, I stopped thinking...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.82,0:39:53.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早就与现在的人脱节了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the way other people think a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.09,0:39:55.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你用现代人的眼光看我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta think like you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.62,0:40:01.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这是事实 - 真的吗 太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I do. - Do you? Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.53,0:40:06.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要面对现实啊 好吗 现在世界变了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta face reality, okay? It's a different world now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.97,0:40:09.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是衣服变了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only the clothes is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.34,0:40:14.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道你想从我这里得到什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I really don't know what you want from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.71,0:40:19.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是想进入你的世界 你也知道 像家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just wanted us to get involved. You know, like, home team.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.71,0:40:27.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无论你在想什么 你在经历什么 总会过去的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, whatever it is, whatever you're going through, it'll pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.39,0:40:29.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 你可能说对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, you're probably right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.55,0:40:32.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时代会赶上所有人的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time is gonna catch up to all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.36,0:40:35.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 特别是当你站得稳的时候 - 别担心了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Especially if you're standing still. - Hey, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.50,0:40:40.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 我早上打电话给你好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I'm gonna call you in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.74,0:40:46.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你告诉你孩子这些东西了吗 顺便问问 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did you tell this to your kid? - Yeah, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.37,0:40:48.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他怎么想 你是疯子 对吧 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What'd he think, you're nuts, right? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.71,0:40:54.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不相信你吗 欢迎来到我的世界 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, well, he don't believe in you? Welcome to my world, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.61,0:40:57.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小洛 没有人给你头衔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocko, nobody's giving you no title shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.02,0:41:00.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道 我不想要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know that. I don't want one.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.59,0:41:02.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个不是一次精神折磨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So this isn't a mental disturbance?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.16,0:41:05.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.72,0:41:08.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你生气了 是因为他们贬低你的社会地位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're mad because they took down your statue?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.33,0:41:11.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.00,0:41:13.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讲真的 不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not really, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.77,0:41:18.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果这是关于钱的 你在脖子上挂张牌 说 来打我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If it's about money, just hang a sign around your neck saying, "Punch me."
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.04,0:41:22.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,五美元一次 你会赚到大钱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five dollars, you'll make big money.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.71,0:41:26.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了 你还没到达人生的高潮吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? You haven't peaked yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.05,0:41:29.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 高潮？ - 是的 高潮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Peaked? - Yeah, peaked.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.88,0:41:32.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道怎么讲 在底下还有点东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. There's still some stuff in the basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.45,0:41:36.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么底下 - 心底\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What basement? - In here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.02,0:41:38.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我说说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me about the stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.99,0:41:43.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这个怎么样 - 跟我说说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What about it? - Tell me about the stuff inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.60,0:41:46.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是生气吗 - 生气？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is it angry? - Angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.20,0:41:48.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你生气是因为你太太离开你了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you mad because Adrian left you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.47,0:41:51.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她不是离开了 保利 她死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She didn't leave, Paulie. She died.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.24,0:41:53.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 好的 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Okay, okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.54,0:42:01.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道吗 有时候 连呼吸都困难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, sometimes it's hard to breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.45,0:42:05.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道吗 我觉得有 一只野兽在我心里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I feel, like, this beast inside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.48,0:42:08.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的 小洛 没事的 好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay, Rocko. Please, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.32,0:42:11.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的 没关系吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.06,0:42:20.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是从来没想过 没有她日子会那么困难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just never knew it was supposed to be this hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.83,0:42:23.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不应该是这样的 保利  你知道吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It wasn't supposed to be like this, Paulie. You know, it...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.78,0:42:35.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有空过来训练一下我吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you wanna come by and help me train?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.11,0:42:37.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在这里有工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got a job here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.98,0:42:39.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我了解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.99,0:42:42.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你记得你说过 在一个地方待久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember you said if you stay one place long enough...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.02,0:42:44.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也成为那个地方了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you become that place?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.02,0:42:47.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小洛 这就是我目前想做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocko, this is all I got.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.73,0:42:50.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我理解 保利 我很理解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I understand, Paulie. I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.83,0:42:58.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,假如你有空来看我训练的话 我会很感激你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you get time and come down and see me train, I'd appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.81,0:43:01.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那当然 小洛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course, Rocko.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.94,0:43:06.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见 保利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bye, Paulie.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.88,0:43:07.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见 小洛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodbye, Rocko.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.31,0:43:08.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见 小洛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodbye, Rocko.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.62,0:43:13.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保重 小洛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take care, Rocko.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.96,0:43:22.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本次宾夕法尼亚州 运动委员会全体委员出席的会议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This plenary session of the Pennsylvania Athletic Commission...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.76,0:43:28.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目的在于审核洛奇·巴尔博亚的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is convened in order to consider the application of Rocky Balboa...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.50,0:43:32.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自由拳击运动员牌照\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...for the issuance of a discretionary professional boxing license...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.90,0:43:37.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,此前由于法律不允许他获得牌照\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...due to his ineligibility to be licensed as a matter of right.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.88,0:43:41.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴尔博亚先生 欢迎你 由于代表自己来凌汛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Balboa, you're welcome here. Since you're representing yourself...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.01,0:43:45.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们欢迎你来做开场白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...we invite you to make an opening statement, if you'd like to.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.32,0:43:47.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不了 我只是好奇而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I was just curious how I did, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.05,0:43:52.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 药物测试局已经通知我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, well, the Medical Advisory Board has informed us...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.76,0:43:55.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你提交的整套运动员测试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that the battery of tests to which you've been subjected...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.86,0:43:59.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都通过了 而且很出色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you've passed these tests with flying colors.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.36,0:44:01.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭喜你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we congratulate you for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.07,0:44:04.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 然而 我们这席人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thanks. - However, this commission...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.14,0:44:08.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出于好意 并不推荐你拿执照\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...in good conscience, cannot recommend you for a license...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.31,0:44:12.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我们拒绝你的申请\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and we therefore deny your application.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.85,0:44:16.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不是做了你们要求的吗 - 是的 你做到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Didn't I do what you asked? - Yes, you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.82,0:44:18.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我应该拿到牌照吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I should get a license, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.85,0:44:20.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是那么简单的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.05,0:44:24.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然你们一开始就不给我通过 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So why did you give me all
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.88,0:44:26.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么还要求我做这些测试呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}them tests if you was never passing me?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.76,0:44:28.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要支持一下做的决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've gotta stand by our decision here...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.89,0:44:32.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就目前来讲要撤消你的请求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and we have to deny your request for a license at this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.54,0:44:47.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一点权利也没有吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo, don't I got some rights?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.31,0:44:49.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在指什么权利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What rights do you think you're referring to?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.58,0:44:52.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就好比一张正式文件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like in that official paper they wrote down the street?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.42,0:44:54.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那是权利和自由法案规定的东西 - 权利和自由法案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's the Bill of Rights. - Bill of Rights.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.52,0:44:56.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上面不是说了要追求你喜欢的东西吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't it say something about going after what makes you happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.92,0:44:59.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 那只是追求幸福 不是法律范围 你的论点是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, that's "the pursuit of happiness." But what's your point?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.86,0:45:03.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的论点是我在追求些东西 没有人支持我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My point is I'm pursuing something, and nobody looks too happy about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.43,0:45:05.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们只是为了你的利益着想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we're just looking out for your interests.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.96,0:45:09.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那谢谢了 或许你为自己着想得多一些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I appreciate that, but maybe you're looking out for your interests more.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.80,0:45:13.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不应该叫申请人到这里 交了款 递交了测试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You shouldn't ask people to come here and pay the freight on something.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.31,0:45:16.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还不行 你们觉得这样做对吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They pay, it still ain't good enough. You think that's right?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.64,0:45:19.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许这是你的工作 但你为什么要阻止我的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you're doing your job, but why you gotta stop me from doing mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.45,0:45:24.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你愿意经受所有考验 去获得你想要的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you're willing to go through all the battling to get where you want to get...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.48,0:45:26.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁有权利阻止你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...who's got the right to stop you?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.38,0:45:29.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许你有些事还没完成 一些你想做的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you got something you never finished, something you wanna do.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.99,0:45:32.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一些你没有向人交代的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something you never said to somebody, something!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.39,0:45:34.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你被人拒绝 即使在你尽力了之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you're told no, even after you pay your dues.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.69,0:45:37.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁有权利否定你 谁？没有谁！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's got the right to tell you that? Who? Nobody!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.46,0:45:40.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,倾听你的内心才叫权利 没有人有权利对你的内心说不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's your right to listen to your gut. It's nobody's right to say no...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.80,0:45:44.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在你嬴取自己的权利后 你可以当你想当的人 做你想做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...after you earn the right to be what you wanna be or do what you wanna do!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.44,0:45:52.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我年纪越大 我就会遗留更多东西 这就是生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The older I get, the more things I gotta leave behind. That's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.71,0:45:57.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫你们留在桌上的唯一的东西 是正确的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only thing I'm asking you guys to leave on the table is what's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.70,0:46:16.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伙计 看了今天的报纸了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo! Have you seen the paper today?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.67,0:46:18.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一行 第一行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Front row. Front row.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.14,0:46:21.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is so great.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.41,0:46:23.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好的 好的 - 去吃点东西吧 吃东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All right, all right. - Let's go get some food. Food.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.08,0:46:27.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 去喝啤酒吧 来啊 - 来啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's get a beer. Come on. - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.38,0:46:30.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上次两场比赛早就被别人遗忘了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The last two pay-per-views were in the toilet.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.62,0:46:33.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没在赚世界拳击冠军应该赚到的钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not making heavyweight-championship money.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.39,0:46:35.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外面不出名的人多得是 小梅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a bunch of nobodies out there, Mase.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.52,0:46:38.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想和你谈谈我们今后可采纳的机遇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanna talk to you about an opportunity we should run with.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.72,0:46:42.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看着我 你听说洛奇·巴尔博亚申请并拿到了执照吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at me. You heard Rocky Balboa applied for a license and got one?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.73,0:46:44.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是 我听说了 别管他 - 听我说 听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I heard. Forget about him. - Hear me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.80,0:46:48.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想让我跟一个我把双手绑在背后也能打得过的人比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want me to fight a guy I can beat with both hands tied behind my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.33,0:46:51.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人人都知道你能打趴下他 但这不是关键\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody knows you could beat him sitting down. That's not what it's about.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.87,0:46:55.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关键是赚钱 我们要把那虚拟化的比赛变成资本\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's about making money. We gotta capitalize on that computer fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.31,0:46:58.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是上百万的买卖 给你就有1500或2000W\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This could do a million buys. That's 15, 20 million to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.21,0:47:00.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 忘了吧 - 你到底想干什么 因为没人会再挤破门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Forget it. - No one's beating the door down...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.38,0:47:03.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 来看你比赛了 - 听着 老大 我们需要有保证的比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...to watch you fight anymore. - We got guaranteed fights.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.21,0:47:06.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么有保证的比赛 你想在你朋友面前比赛吗 我们来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna do this now in front of your friends, we'll do it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.35,0:47:09.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们什么也没有 所有的你想参与的比赛都被拒绝了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got nothing. All the pay-per-view fights you come up with got rejected.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.99,0:47:10.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想知道为什么吗 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.96,0:47:13.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外面到处都是无家可归的流浪者 没人关心他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're all bums out there. Nobody cares about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.93,0:47:17.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有市场价值了 但是巴尔博亚的这件事很有意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no marquee value. But this Balboa thing is interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.96,0:47:19.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不想干 - 听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't wanna do it. - Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.70,0:47:22.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是一个"有过什么"决不是"会有什么的"世界 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a has-been, never-gonna-be world.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.12,0:47:23.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以称之为怀旧 或无论什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} Call it nostalgia, whatever you want...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.77,0:47:26.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但人们总是和那有联系 这不会损失什么 挺好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but people relate to that stuff. This is a no-lose. It's all good.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.44,0:47:30.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 对谁好 - 你! 不是我! 你!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good for who? - For you! Not for me! For you!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.38,0:47:33.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等下 也许你不明白 人们不喜欢你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you don't understand. People don't like you no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.48,0:47:36.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们不再追捧你了 他们不再支持你了 明白不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They don't follow you. They're not supporting you anymore. Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.12,0:47:39.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别好像我玷污了你的传统似的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't look at me like I'm messing with your legacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.42,0:47:41.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每个运动员都认为自己有传统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every jock now thinks they got a legacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.32,0:47:44.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,传统是你能赚到钱而不是如何花钱 这就叫传统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A legacy is what you get instead of getting paid. That's a legacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.42,0:47:46.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 哥们 别跟我说话好像我傻似的 - 没 没 我不说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't talk to me like I'm stupid. - I'm not no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.16,0:47:50.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人人都知道你能海扁这老家伙 但你没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody knows you could kick this old man's ass. But you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.90,0:47:52.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给他稍稍留点尊严 人们就会说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave him with a little dignity, so they say:
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.10,0:47:56.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,梅森·迪克逊真有同情心 真是好样的 好人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Mason Dixon's got compassion. He's a decent guy, he's a nice guy."
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.77,0:47:59.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就会有新的追随者 我们可以把我的钱翻倍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You get a whole new audience, we'll double your money.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.34,0:48:01.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想有个新的形象吗 那你就这么做吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want a new image? That's how you get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.57,0:48:03.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来取代你俩给建立的形象吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To replace the one that you two made?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.48,0:48:06.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 我们给你铺的路 是你自己搞的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa, wait. We made your world green. You made the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.48,0:48:08.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是你 你导致那些垃圾事发生的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is you. You made all this junk happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.61,0:48:10.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我受不了这乱七八糟的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've had it up to here with this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.48,0:48:12.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是时候做些改变了 我要去马丁的体育馆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time for me to make changes. I'm going to Martin's gym.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.15,0:48:14.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们一会再谈吧 - 忘了这些废话吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We'll talk about it. - Forget this crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.05,0:48:17.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想马丁 回来 没什么可谈的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want Martin back. There's nothing to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.13,0:48:29.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你好啊? - 真是惊喜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How you doing? - Hey, what a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.07,0:48:32.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我开车到附近 然后我想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was driving around the neighborhood, I thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.64,0:48:35.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 为什么我不开车过来打个招呼呢 - 想进来吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...why not drive by and say hello? - You wanna come inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.44,0:48:38.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不了 狗狗得锻炼下 你想散散步吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, the dog needs some exercise. You wanna take a little walk?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.64,0:48:41.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 恩 恩 好的 - 户外很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, yeah. All right. - It's nice outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.21,0:48:43.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 舒服又凉快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All right. - Nice and brisk.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.95,0:48:45.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么时候弄的只狗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When did you get a dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.32,0:48:47.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们几天前买的小爆头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We picked up Punchy a couple of days back.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.59,0:48:48.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 小爆头? - 恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Punchy? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.95,0:48:50.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你叫你的狗小爆头?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You named your dog Punchy?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.36,0:48:52.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你儿子想的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your kid come up with the name.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.22,0:48:54.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊? 我想这有点失礼了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah? I think that's disrespectful.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.83,0:48:56.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不 挺好 真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no, no. It's fine, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.76,0:49:00.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 很容易记 挺好的 你要知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it's easy to remember and it's all that, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.23,0:49:03.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 来饭店你认为怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, what do you think about coming over to the restaurant?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.40,0:49:06.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 干什么? - 那个 你知道 来 好像...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What for? - Well, you know, for, like...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.60,0:49:10.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上班 女服务员要生孩子了 你会做的很好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For work. The hostess is gonna be having a kid. You'd do good.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.21,0:49:12.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不确定 - 我来告诉你 你会做的很好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't know. - I'm telling you, you'd do so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.91,0:49:15.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很感激你为我儿子做事 但是我不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I appreciate what you're doing for my kid, but I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.55,0:49:18.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 我认为你会喜欢的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, listen, I think you'd like it a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.18,0:49:20.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那环境很好 很让人舒心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a nice environment, it's very pleasant.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.79,0:49:22.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 我们能不谈吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, can we drop it?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.32,0:49:26.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么困难吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's bothering you?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.99,0:49:29.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没 挺好的 那个 我要回去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing. It's all right. Listen, I gotta get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.66,0:49:32.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不 不好 - 哦 算了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, it ain't all right. - Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.93,0:49:34.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 怎么? - 我将是人们进来...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - I'm gonna be the first person...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.97,0:49:37.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- ...看见的第一个人? - 你发递菜单就行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...people see when they walk in? -  You give out menus.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.57,0:49:40.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说"欢迎光临" 给客人找座\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You say, "Hello, how are you?" You sit people down.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.51,0:49:42.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看 假如我能做 人人都可以做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, if I can do it, anybody can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.94,0:49:46.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能找到10个100个更好的人来干这工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could find 10 better people, a hundred better people for this job.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.38,0:49:48.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,试下吧 就2周\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give it a try, like two weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.38,0:49:50.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't wanna try.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.35,0:49:52.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谁给你装进了这思想? - 没人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who put this stuff in your head? - Nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.75,0:49:54.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种思想不会自己在脑子里出现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it just don't get in there by itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.32,0:50:00.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢来看我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks for coming by.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.16,0:50:06.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你最后一次跳舞是什么时候? 有一段时间了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo, when was the last time you went dancing? Has it been a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.83,0:50:08.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 为什么这么问? - 是因为你和这些难题可以跳舞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why are you asking? - I'm asking because...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.87,0:50:12.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也许也可以和我一起跳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you dance around these problems, you might as well dance with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.30,0:50:15.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也许跳的不太好 但怎么也比熊强吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ain't that good, but I'm better than the average bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.51,0:50:18.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这出自哪 我忘了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where that came from, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.81,0:50:20.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你疯了 - 有点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're crazy. - A little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.45,0:50:23.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是你想和谈话的方式 也有点疯狂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the way you're thinking and talking, it's a little crazy too.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.58,0:50:28.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 你挺好的 真的 过来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, you deserve better. Really. Come on over.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.39,0:50:32.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要你来把我地方分分类 费城需要你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you to class my place up. Philly needs you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.99,0:50:36.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,假如你再要说"X 你, 人渣"我完全理解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if you say, "Screw you, creepo" again, I totally understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.83,0:50:39.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我警告你 我要站在...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'm warning you, I'm gonna put myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.43,0:50:41.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...这的街道中心...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...in the middle of the street here...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.47,0:50:44.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...我和小爆头 朝第一辆共车喊:\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and stand here, me and Punchy, and wave to the first bus, say:
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.57,0:50:46.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"过来 碾碎我吧!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Come on over here and mash me!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.47,0:50:48.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小玛丽拒绝了饭店的工作.\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Little Marie turned down the job at the restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.11,0:50:50.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她认为比我们都强''\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She thinks she's better than us."
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.98,0:50:54.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的? 呵呵 这已经20年没公车了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah? Well, there hasn't been a bus down here in 20 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.88,0:50:56.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 真的? - 恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.95,0:51:00.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大概是利润很低\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was a close call.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.65,0:51:06.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的 来吧 会好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, seriously. Come on over. It'd be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.29,0:51:10.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.98,0:51:30.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保利!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Paulie!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.89,0:51:35.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 保利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, Paulie.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.09,0:51:38.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.05,0:52:13.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好? 把我的不寻常的东西放这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How are you? Get my unusual up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.36,0:52:16.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思 快递放后面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me. Deliveries are in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.29,0:52:17.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是送快递的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not a delivery guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.16,0:52:19.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那 你定座了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, do you have a reservation?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.13,0:52:22.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我像是个疯狂的印第安人吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do I look like a freaking Indian?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.84,0:52:28.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛克 洛奇?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Rock? Rocky?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.04,0:52:35.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想我们这出了点麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we've got a little bit of a problem with this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.98,0:52:38.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麻烦? 不 不 他是熟人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Problem? No, no, he's just a relative.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.48,0:52:40.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.29,0:52:44.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo, Paulie.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.99,0:52:48.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你眼睛怎么了? - 我打的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What happened to your eye? - I hit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.29,0:52:51.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 为什么? - 必须打\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why? - Needed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.73,0:52:53.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生什么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.23,0:52:55.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我庆祝呢 洛克 - 怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm celebrating, Rock. - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.13,0:52:58.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 光荣退休 - 退休?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I retired. - Retired?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.41,0:53:07.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么他们什么时候开始给退休的人猪肉了...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So when did they start giving retired people meat...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.18,0:53:09.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...而不是表 保利?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...instead of watches, Paulie?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.15,0:53:14.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不需要表\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't need a watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.95,0:53:19.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有表! 你给我了一块表!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got a watch! You gave me a watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.56,0:53:20.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保利…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Paulie...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.99,0:53:23.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我他妈不需要表.\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't need no goddamn watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.16,0:53:28.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 保利. - 我有一块表!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yo, Paulie. - I got a watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.60,0:53:31.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有两块呢!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got two watches!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.07,0:53:34.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保利!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo, Paulie!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.58,0:53:47.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保利.\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo, Paulie.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.25,0:53:50.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.06,0:53:55.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让人重返赛场是很需要勇气的 认识到自己会受到打击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It takes guts climbing back in that ring, knowing you're gonna take a beating.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.16,0:54:00.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能做好的 洛克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna do all right, Rocko.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.33,0:54:01.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么知道?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.57,0:54:06.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地下室里的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The stuff in the basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.12,0:54:18.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢了 保利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, Paulie.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.65,0:54:26.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 嘿 洛克 你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey. - Hey, Rock, how are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.93,0:54:30.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗? - 恩 挺好的 你哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You okay? - Yeah, good. How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.23,0:54:31.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 恩 好 好极了 - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, fine. This is great. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.03,0:54:34.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那有人想和你谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, some guys over there wanna talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.87,0:54:37.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好的 谢谢你 - 好的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay. You got it. - Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.11,0:54:43.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谢谢赏脸 十分感激 - 别客气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thanks for coming by. I appreciate it. - Our pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.98,0:54:45.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 想听故事? - 哪种故事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wanna hear stories? - What kind of stories?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.18,0:54:48.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很多人来想听听我打拳的故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, a lot of people like to hear these old fight stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.05,0:54:50.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 过会儿吧 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Maybe later. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.68,0:54:53.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫路·迪拜勒 这是埃索·卢加 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Lou DiBella. This is L.C. Luco.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.22,0:54:55.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是梅森·迪克逊的经理人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} He's Mason Dixon's manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.35,0:54:57.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 为什么你不坐下和我们聊聊? - 好啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Will you sit down and join us? - Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.32,0:55:02.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道 我们有奖励的合同关于梅森·迪克逊...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, we have the promotional contract for Mason Dixon...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.29,0:55:03.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- ...他是你的拳迷 - 真的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...who's a big fan. - Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.00,0:55:06.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当他听说你有兴趣打拳...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When he heard you were interested in fighting...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.30,0:55:08.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...他想你为什么不试试?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...he thought why not try to work something out?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.70,0:55:11.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比如特殊赛事 顶级的表演赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like a special event. Like a first-class exhibition fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.27,0:55:15.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 为什么是我? - 他太TM崇拜你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why me? - He respects the hell out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.54,0:55:19.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行吗? 我们照直说了 那个虚拟的比赛太吸引人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right? And let's be honest, that computer fight got people curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.68,0:55:22.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这会很是有趣 - 我不太有兴趣...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This could be very interesting. - I ain't interested...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.28,0:55:24.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,... 在 象 胖揍和使人尴尬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...in getting, like, mangled and embarrassed.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.58,0:55:26.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 那决不会发生 绝对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, that's not gonna happen. Never happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.92,0:55:31.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说实话 我想参加...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Truthfully, I was thinking more on a, like...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.49,0:55:35.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...小型的 不显眼的比赛 你看 小的 不是大赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...miniscule, small level. You know. Small fights, not big fights.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.36,0:55:39.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小型的 比如 本地的 你明白我说的吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Small fights. Things that... Local. You know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.46,0:55:42.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,主意不错 别考虑是大型的 考虑只是表演赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not a bad idea. Don't think of it as big. Think of it like an exhibition.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.17,0:55:46.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,考虑这是荣誉拳击手对话 这是你喜欢的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think of it as a glorified sparring session. Here's something you'll like.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.90,0:55:49.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们将把部分门票捐给慈善机构\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna donate a portion of the gate to charity.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.61,0:55:51.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这总是不错的 - 给予总是好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's always nice. - It's good to give.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.88,0:55:53.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.78,0:55:55.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在哪比赛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's it taking place?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.55,0:55:56.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 拉斯维加斯 - 拉斯维加斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Las Vegas. - Las Vegas.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.08,0:56:00.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,舒适又温暖 这冷的能整死你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice and warm. This cold's gotta be killing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.52,0:56:02.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 有点僵硬 - 暖活点你会移动的更好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Little stiff. - You move better when you're warmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.49,0:56:05.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 恩 - 另外...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - And if nothing else...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.29,0:56:07.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...你又有新的故事可讲了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you'll have new stories to tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.66,0:56:10.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我确实觉得该考虑下了 - 的确\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I really gotta think about this. - Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.66,0:56:13.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 可以吗? - 我理解 没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is that okay? - I understand. No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.43,0:56:15.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要过去那边 你可以点些吃的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna go over there. You can order something.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.80,0:56:17.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你推荐什么? - 还都能吃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do you recommend? - It's all edible.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.81,0:56:23.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.01,0:56:27.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们说服他了 想像迪克逊 遇见这王八蛋在他状态好的时候?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got him. Imagine if Dixon met this bastard in his prime?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.01,0:56:30.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他会杀了他 杀了他 - 真没开玩笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He'd kill him. Kill him. - You ain't kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.02,0:56:33.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哥们 有点迷惑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man, I'm confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.59,0:56:42.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不认为这会发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't think this was gonna come along.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.66,0:56:44.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但这就是你想要的 不是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But this is what you wanted, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.46,0:56:46.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道 你知道 我天天讲啊讲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. You know, I talk and I talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.93,0:56:49.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有时我认为我说的就是真的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes I think what I'm saying is true...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.20,0:56:53.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...但当我看我自己时 我又不确定真的是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and then I look at myself and I'm not even sure what is true anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.70,0:56:56.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为这就像 我产生了关于打拳的疯狂的念头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because it's like, I pushed this crazy idea about fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.87,0:56:58.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的意思是 这些都是干什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, what's it all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.61,0:57:01.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真的关心近距离近战和其他的什么吗...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do I really care about standing toe to toe and all that stuff...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.71,0:57:05.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...或者 就像我孩子说的 自我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...or, like my kid says, is it just, like, ego?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.48,0:57:09.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者我就是用新痛代替旧伤的老拳师?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or am I this old pug who's just trying to replace old pain with new pain?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.42,0:57:12.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道 真的不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.79,0:57:16.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看 我知道我平常说的不多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I know I usually don't say a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.73,0:57:20.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我总是听和看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm always listening and looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.97,0:57:25.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是你是谁 你的一部分充满了生活...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But who you are, the part of you that's so full of life...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.07,0:57:28.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...我们都能感觉到 那团火...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...we all have that feeling, that fire...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.31,0:57:32.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...却没有机会来用它 然后它就消失了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but usually never get a chance to use it. And then it just goes away.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.98,0:57:37.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是你能 你有这机会 那就去做吧 为什么不呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you can. You've got this opportunity, so do it. Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.08,0:57:42.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的意思是这就是 你一直以来的样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, this is who you are. This is who you'll always be.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.55,0:57:45.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且你不用为任何人让路 除非你真的想走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you don't move aside for nobody until you're ready to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.02,0:57:48.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别人怎么看这件事并不重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it doesn't matter how this looks to other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.99,0:57:51.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重要的是你的看法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All that matters is how it looks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.46,0:57:54.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.20,0:57:58.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇 看着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky, look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.30,0:58:02.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的看法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How it looks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.74,0:58:05.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,假如这是你想做的事...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if this is something that you wanna do...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.91,0:58:09.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...假如这是你要做的 那你就去做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and if this is something that you gotta do, then you do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.35,0:58:13.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斗士就是要战斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fighters fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.75,0:58:19.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是想揍我吧 啊?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not gonna punch me, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.79,0:58:26.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要走了 呆的太久了 明天见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, I gotta go before I wear out my welcome. I'll see you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.90,0:58:29.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.04,0:58:42.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斗士要战斗 对吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fighters fight, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.59,0:58:52.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,举办比拳赛还要大型的活动是很难得的 这是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's rare when you get to promote an event bigger than boxing. This is.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.72,0:58:56.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技术与意志的比拚 部分收益将捐给慈善机构\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Skill versus will, with part of the proceeds going to charity.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.66,0:59:00.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,梅森·迪克逊的好主意 来纪念过去的重量级拳王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The brainchild of Mason Dixon, to honor past heavyweight champions.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.03,0:59:04.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如洛奇·巴尔博亚一样的战士 我们现在开始发问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Warriors like Rocky Balboa. Let's open it up for questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.44,0:59:05.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冠军!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, champ!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.80,0:59:09.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一些伟大的拳击手 在他们50多岁还比赛 下场惨痛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A few great fighters have fought in their 50s, often with disastrous results.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.97,0:59:11.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么你要冒着危险和困窘的危险比赛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why risk the danger and embarrassment?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.81,0:59:14.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,消息灵通人士说你事实上没机会赢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The smart money says you have virtually no chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.41,0:59:18.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拳击手总是有机会的 这场比赛会很有竞争性的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A puncher always has a chance. This fight will be competitive.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.92,0:59:21.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么这么做 洛奇?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you doing this, Rocky?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.09,0:59:26.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道 我更喜欢 做我十分喜欢做的 而不是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know, I'd rather do something I love badly than...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.42,0:59:31.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做一些我不喜欢的事而感觉很糟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Than to feel bad by not doing something you love.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.80,0:59:34.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇 媒体都称你为发酵的巴尔博亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky, the press has labeled you a Balboasaurus.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.33,0:59:37.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对于这你是怎么看的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you feel about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.17,0:59:40.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,梅森 让我们谈下以后发生的事:\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's say the following happens:
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.08,0:59:42.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你赢了 我们会说你把老头打败了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You win, we'll say you beat an old guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.31,0:59:45.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你败了 虽然不太可能 你就会成为以后的笑话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You lose, say a thumb in the eye, you'll be the joke of the decade.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.98,0:59:49.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们都知道这不会发生 这仅仅是个表演赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You all know that will never happen. This is only an exhibition.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.55,0:59:52.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以后别再大张旗鼓的搞这些了 有电脑搞就行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't go trying to make more out of this than that computer tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.85,0:59:58.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个运动不是已经够乱了吗 为什么还要搞这些马戏表演\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't this sport in enough trouble without these circus events?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.76,1:00:01.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 下个问题 - 表面上看 这看起来好像...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Next question. - On the surface, this looks like...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.23,1:00:03.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...毫无价值的拳击表演在 没有冒犯的意思...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...a cheap bit of ring theater between, no offense...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.79,1:00:06.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...过时的和一个有着可靠传统和...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...a has-been and a man whose own credible legacy...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.50,1:00:07.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...受欢迎性存在疑问的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and popularity is in doubt.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.17,1:00:09.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 看点在哪儿? - 疑问?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's the upside? - Doubt?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.97,1:00:12.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看点? 我说...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Upside? I mean...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.67,1:00:16.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你什么意思 看点? 我的意思是 我必须做什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean, upside? I mean, what do I have to do?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.58,1:00:19.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们都知道 我的战绩 33-0 有30击倒获胜.\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I'm 33-0 with 30 knockouts.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.11,1:00:23.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在帮你们忙 我带来这个表演赛给你们看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm doing you people a favor. I'm having this exhibition for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.21,1:00:26.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们过来这是为了嘲笑我? 我是冠军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gonna get up here and make a mockery out of me? I'm the champ.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.88,1:00:29.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的意思是 我生气了 这家伙会受伤的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, I get pissed, this guy get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.99,1:00:31.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赛场上见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See you at the fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.76,1:00:38.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这家伙是个笑话 他会被打扁的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The guy's a joke. He's gonna get crushed.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.77,1:00:49.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 快 谁在这 - 你好?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Look who's here. - How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.67,1:00:51.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 看到我爸了吗? - 他在后面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Have you seen my father? - He's in the back.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.11,1:00:54.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这地方从来没有这么多人吃饭 真难以置信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This place has never served this many meals. It's unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.11,1:00:59.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃的还好吗? 真希望你都喜欢 好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're doing good? Hope you're enjoying everything, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.45,1:01:02.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.66,1:01:08.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样? 真高兴你顺路来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How you doing? Glad you come by.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.79,1:01:09.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能跟你谈谈吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I talk with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.23,1:01:12.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 当然 - 出去谈行吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sure. - Can we do it outside?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.57,1:01:20.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你真的想弄这个? - 对 明天开始训练\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So you're going through with this? - I start training tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.57,1:01:23.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛克 我找了些关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Rock. I made some connections.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.97,1:01:26.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能通过这赚些钱 广告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can make some money on this, endorsements.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.51,1:01:28.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然可以 做吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Absolutely. Do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.11,1:01:31.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 洛克 好的 - 恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you, Rock. Okay. - Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.25,1:01:35.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 比赛紧张吗? - 怕的要死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So you nervous about the fight? - Scared to death.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.82,1:01:38.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你看起来并不害怕 - 呵呵 我并不像看起来那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You don't look scared. - Well, I ain't supposed to.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.72,1:01:41.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你并不非要做这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you don't have to do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.29,1:01:43.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 我想我需要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, I think I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.70,1:01:49.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要知道 与你生活并不容易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, living with you, it hasn't been easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.03,1:01:52.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人们看到 但想的确是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People see me but they think of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.84,1:01:55.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在不仅这样 而且比以前更坏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now with all this going on, it's gonna be worse than ever.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.84,1:01:57.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 事情并不非要这样 - 就是这样!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It don't have to be. - Sure it does!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.94,1:02:00.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 为什么? 孩子 你有很多东西啊 - 什么 我的姓?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why? You've got a lot going on, kid. - What, my last name?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.84,1:02:02.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是我找到像样的工作的原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the reason I got a decent job.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.95,1:02:05.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是人们把我的事放在第一位办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why people deal with me in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.32,1:02:06.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我刚开始不需要这样了...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I start to get a little ahead...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.15,1:02:11.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...我开始有属于自己世界了 但是这事就发生了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I start to get a little something for myself, and this happens.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.26,1:02:14.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在 我求你能不能不参加这比赛了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, I'm asking you as a favor not to go through with this.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.69,1:02:17.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这对你不会是好结果 对我也不会是好结果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is gonna end up bad for you, and it's gonna end up bad for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.03,1:02:20.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你认为我伤害了你? - 是 在某方面 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You think I'm hurting you? - Yeah. In a way, you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.10,1:02:22.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是我最不会做的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the last thing I ever wanted to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.13,1:02:26.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你不想 但是事情就是这样发展的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know that's not what you wanna do, but that's just the way that it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.74,1:02:29.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不管人们怎么想吗? 人们拿你作笑话...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you care what people think? Doesn't it bother you that people...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.01,1:02:33.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...你不着急吗? 然后我也会被卷进来?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...are making you out to be a joke and that I'll be included in that?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.24,1:02:36.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你认为这样对吗? 啊?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you think that's right? Do you?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.29,1:02:47.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不会相信这些的 但你过去就这么打\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ain't gonna believe this, but you used to fit right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.39,1:02:49.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我握着你 对你妈妈说:\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd hold you up and say to your mother:
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.79,1:02:52.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,''这孩子会成为世界上最好的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"This kid is gonna be the best kid in the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.53,1:02:55.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这孩子会成为比我认识的所有人都厉害的人物''\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This kid is gonna be somebody better than anybody ever knew."
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.93,1:02:58.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后你长大了 健康又令人惊奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you grew up good and wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.94,1:03:02.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看你长大真是奇妙 每一天都像上天给我的特权\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was great just watching, every day was like a privilege.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.24,1:03:05.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后到了你成人的时候了 承担起了你的世界...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then the time come for you to be your own man and take on the world...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.61,1:03:10.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...你确实这样 但是沿着线的某处 你变了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and you did. But somewhere along the line, you changed.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.31,1:03:11.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不再是你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You stopped being you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.75,1:03:15.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你让人家戳着你脸告诉你你并不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You let people stick a finger in your face and tell you you're no good.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.22,1:03:18.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当事情变得困难了 你开始寻找你要责怪的东西...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And when things got hard, you started looking for something to blame...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.06,1:03:21.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...如巨大阴影\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...like a big shadow.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.63,1:03:24.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我来告诉你些你已经知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me tell you something you already know.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.06,1:03:27.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个世界不全是阳光和彩虹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The world ain't all sunshine and rainbows.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.56,1:03:31.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是个非常刻薄和肮脏的地方 它不管你多么强壮...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a very mean and nasty place, and I don't care how tough you are...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.57,1:03:33.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...它会打倒你 跪倒在它面前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...it will beat you to your
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.36,1:03:35.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不反抗的话它会一直让你这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} knees and keep you there if you let it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.81,1:03:39.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你 我 没人会像生活那样的重击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You, me or nobody is gonna hit as hard as life.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.98,1:03:44.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但关键不是你能打得多么厉害 而是你能承受多大的重击...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it ain't about how hard you hit. It's about how hard you can get hit...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.28,1:03:45.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...然后一直向前走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and keep moving forward.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.85,1:03:49.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能承受多少和然后一直向前走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much you can take and keep moving forward.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.22,1:03:51.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是赢的真谛!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's how winning is done!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.09,1:03:54.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,假如你知道自己的价值 那就去实现自己的价值\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you know what you're worth, go and get what you're worth.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.99,1:03:58.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是你要能够承受重击 不是指着手指...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you gotta be willing to take the hits, and not pointing fingers...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.43,1:04:02.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...说着你不是你想做的那样 因为他 她 或其他人!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...saying you ain't where you wanna be because of him or her or anybody!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.70,1:04:06.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,懦夫才这样 而不是你! 你不该这样!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cowards do that, and that ain't you! You're better than that!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.68,1:04:17.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会一直爱你 无论...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm always gonna love you no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.18,1:04:19.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无论发生了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No matter what happens.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.42,1:04:22.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是我的儿子 我的骨肉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're my son and you're my blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.39,1:04:25.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是我这辈子最好的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the best thing in my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.39,1:04:30.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是除非你开始相信自己 你才会有个新的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But until you start believing in yourself, you ain't gonna have a life.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.10,1:04:37.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别忘了去看看你妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't forget to visit your mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.48,1:05:30.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 啊 这些真漂亮 - 恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, those are beautiful. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.06,1:05:35.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你早退了? - 没\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You get off early from work? - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.59,1:05:37.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我辞了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I left.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.73,1:05:39.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不干了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I quit.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.03,1:05:41.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不干了 为什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quit, why?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.73,1:05:45.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是很...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wasn't very...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.74,1:05:48.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道 就是... 我不适合那\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know, I just... I didn't fit in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.91,1:05:52.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我理解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.01,1:06:00.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那么 你想做什么? - 现在?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So, what are you gonna do? - Right now?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.79,1:06:04.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我更想跟你在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right now I'd rather be with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.72,1:06:08.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.86,1:06:11.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.00,1:06:14.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好久都没看比赛了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been a long time since I seen a fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.68,1:06:26.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道那儿的人好像都懂拳击...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know all there is to know about fighting...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.74,1:06:28.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道那儿的人好像都懂拳击...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know all there is to know about fighting...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.08,1:06:32.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...所以我们没必要再走那条老路了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...so there's no sense us going down that same old road again.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.42,1:06:36.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打败那家伙 你需要速度 但你没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To beat this guy, you need speed. You don't have it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.06,1:06:41.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的膝盖受不了重击 所以不能剧烈跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And your knees can't take the pounding, so hard running is out.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.16,1:06:45.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的颈部有关节炎 你还有钙沉积在...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you got arthritis in your neck. And you've got calcium deposits...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.06,1:06:49.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...大部分关节 所以快速轻拳也用不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...on most of your joints, so sparring is out.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.30,1:06:51.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有那问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had that problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.67,1:06:57.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我们需要的是好的老式的钝击创伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what we'll be calling on is good old-fashioned blunt-force trauma.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.04,1:07:02.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大马力 有耐力 坚固的 打桩机的拳头...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Horsepower. Heavy-duty, cast-iron, pile-driving punches...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.88,1:07:05.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,..会让他疼得哭爹喊娘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that will have to hurt so much they'll rattle his ancestors.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.48,1:07:08.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每次你打他一下...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every time you hit him with a shot...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.39,1:07:11.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...就好像他要亲吻特快火车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...it's gotta feel like he tried kissing the express train.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.69,1:07:16.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们来开始制作杀伤力的炸弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah! Let's start building some hurting bombs.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.93,1:07:51.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你能做到 - 你能的 洛克!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, you'll get it. - You can do it, Rocko!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.63,1:08:29.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变得更强!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Getting stronger!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.60,1:08:33.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 起! 起! 起! - 加油!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Up! Up! Up! - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.27,1:08:36.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,起!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.22,1:08:48.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油 洛克!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Rocko!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.03,1:08:58.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油 加油 来打它们 打它们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Come on. Let's hit them. Hit them.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.87,1:09:05.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能行的 洛克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can do it, Rock.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.31,1:09:09.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变得更强!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Getting stronger!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.55,1:09:23.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 起 起 起! - 冲! 冲!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Up, up, up! - Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.59,1:09:26.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.99,1:10:03.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇·巴尔博亚  2 1 7 磅!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky Balboa, 217!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.79,1:10:09.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无可争议的重量级冠军 梅森·迪克逊 2 2 1 磅 !\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The undisputed heavyweight champion, Mason Dixon, 221!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.94,1:10:15.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常感谢 我很感激 冠军 多谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you very much. I appreciate it, champ. Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.05,1:10:26.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇! 洛奇! 洛奇!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky! Rocky! Rocky!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.26,1:10:34.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你知道这有多少钱吗? - 很多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Know how much money is in this? - A lot of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.52,1:10:36.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想像试着清理这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Imagine trying to clean this place.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.06,1:10:38.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不 真的 - 巴尔博亚!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, seriously. - Balboa!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.13,1:10:44.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哥们 马上就赶上你们 好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys, I'll catch up with you all later, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.07,1:10:47.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗伯特 为什么不和我一起来?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Robert, why don't you hang with me?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.44,1:10:51.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 最近怎样 冠军? - 很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How you doing, champ? - I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.88,1:10:55.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有理由让我们俩在比赛中受伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No reason for neither one of us to get hurt in this fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.68,1:10:58.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会尽量撑着 使你不会丢脸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll do my best to carry you, make sure you save face.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.85,1:11:00.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么可丢脸的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There'd be no embarrassment.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.82,1:11:05.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我向你发誓 假如你试着压我 你打我 你伤了我...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I promise you, you try to press me, you hit me, you hurt me...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.32,1:11:08.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,..你打我下盘 偷袭我 我会把你打飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you hit me low, cheap-shot me, I'll get you out of there.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.29,1:11:14.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道 很多人来拉斯维加斯会输 我可不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, a lot of people come to Vegas to lose. I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.66,1:11:15.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这已经结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's already over.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.13,1:11:18.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有什么结束了除非它真的结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ain't nothing over till it's over.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.20,1:11:19.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这句话从那来的 80年代的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that from, the '80s?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.04,1:11:22.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大概是70年代的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's probably the '70s.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.28,1:11:26.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记住我说的就行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just remember what I said.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.31,1:11:30.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冠军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, yo, champ.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.58,1:11:32.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不怕吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo, ain't you a little scared?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.18,1:11:35.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没怕过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't get scared.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.09,1:11:40.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想你有点怕的话你就会更努力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you try a little harder when you're scared.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.12,1:11:44.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这句话以前对我管用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is what has worked for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.06,1:11:47.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我可不怕 - 哦 真的 你不怕我?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I ain't scared. -  Oh, yeah. You ain't scared of me?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.60,1:11:50.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来来 我看看你会啥 来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's see what you got. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.17,1:11:51.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别打我 我很弱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, don't hit me, I'm brittle.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.28,1:12:08.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.15,1:12:10.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 忙吗? - 我刚想事呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How you doing? - I was just thinking.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.99,1:12:13.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你想进来吗? - 不 不 不 挺好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did you wanna come in? - No, no, no, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.46,1:12:15.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是想...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just wanted to...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.79,1:12:18.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...我不知道 路过来看看你 祝你明天好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I don' t know, come by and wish you good luck for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.76,1:12:20.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thanks. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.76,1:12:22.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我给你带了点东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I brought you something.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.90,1:12:25.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望你不介意 我从饭店带来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope you don't mind, I took it from the restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.40,1:12:27.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.37,1:12:29.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾德里安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Adrian.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.31,1:12:32.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 我想她能保佑你没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Thought she would keep you safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.24,1:12:34.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 对 她总给我带来好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Yeah, she always brought me luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.85,1:12:36.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.28,1:12:42.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想对你对我和我儿子做的事表示感谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanted to say thanks for everything you've done for me and my kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.12,1:12:45.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你很伟大 还有...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been great and...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.46,1:12:51.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道 明天...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, tomorrow...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.83,1:12:56.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...你要证明最不能标志人的年龄是人的心脏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you're gonna prove that the last thing to age on somebody is their heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.87,1:13:01.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我会尽力的 - 你去给他们看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll try. - You go show them.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.24,1:13:02.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.13,1:13:25.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重量级拳王是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The heavyweight championship has been...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.10,1:13:29.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,120年来最令人觊觎的头衔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...one of sports' most coveted titles for 120 years.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.00,1:13:32.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两界重量级拳王 洛奇·巴尔博亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two-time heavyweight champion Rocky Balboa...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.57,1:13:35.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,费城的子弹头 拥有有名的坚固的下颚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the Philadelphia slugger, renowned for his cast-iron jaw...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.84,1:13:38.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凶猛的攻击 和钢铁般的意志\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...ferocious body attack and will of steel...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.11,1:13:41.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有的这些使这小个的斗士的胜利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...all of which have carried the smaller fighter to victories...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.15,1:13:45.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和这些身体条件更好的对手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...over the years against physically superior opponents.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.72,1:13:48.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,梅森·迪克逊 当今的重量级拳王保持者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Mason Dixon, the current heavyweight title holder...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.49,1:13:51.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拥有着高速 决心 和所有斗士都想要的信心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...with all the speed, determination and confidence any fighter could want.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.02,1:13:55.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是很多人都对他是否有 成为真的冠军的心表示怀疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But many still question whether he has the heart of a true champion...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.16,1:13:59.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他从未被逼到山穷水尽 今晚 我们拭目以待\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...never having been pushed to go the distance. Tonight, we find out.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.56,1:14:04.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在内华达州拉斯维加斯的曼德勒海湾会议中心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here at the Mandalay Bay Event Center in Las Vegas...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.20,1:14:06.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来转播大家期望很久的争霸战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...for the much-anticipated showdown...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.20,1:14:08.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在 梅森·"分界线"·迪克逊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...between Mason "The Line" Dixon...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.31,1:14:11.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和洛奇·"意大利种马"·巴尔博亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and Rocky "The Italian Stallion" Balboa.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.71,1:14:13.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是吉姆·兰普利 和 拉里·莫什特 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, I'm Jim Lampley with Larry Merchant
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.41,1:14:14.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有 马克斯·卡勒曼...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} and Max Kellerman...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.81,1:14:18.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...住在拉斯维加斯的曼德勒海湾酒店 在那儿我们预测...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...live from the Mandalay Bay Hotel in Las Vegas, where we anticipate...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.18,1:14:21.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...这将是拳击史上最残酷和最引人注目的比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...one of the most outrageous and compelling events in boxing history.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.55,1:14:25.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不被人欣赏的重量级冠军 梅森·"分界线"·迪克逊...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The unappreciated heavyweight champion, Mason "The Line" Dixon...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.46,1:14:27.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不惜陪上自己的名誉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...putting his reputation on the line...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.56,1:14:30.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,与传奇的前重量级拳王洛奇·巴尔博亚对决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...against legendary ex-champion, Rocky Balboa.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.70,1:14:34.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使这样大多数人仍把着看作神圣化的拳击对话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even though most see this as more of a glorified sparring session...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.93,1:14:36.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...这地方的能量已经可以导电了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the energy in the room is electric.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.07,1:14:39.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拉里 为什么这次比赛被宣传成表演赛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Larry, why is this billed as an exhibition?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.34,1:14:43.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,臆测: 这样他们就不会称之为死刑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wild guess: So they wouldn't have to call it an execution.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.31,1:14:49.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,撒迦利亚的4章6节写道:"不是倚靠势力 不是倚靠才能...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zacariah 4:6 says, "It is not by strength, not by might...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.68,1:14:53.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...乃是倚靠我的灵方能成事...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but by his spirit we have already claimed the victory...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.62,1:14:56.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...万军之耶和华说"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...in our Lord Jesus Christ."
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.95,1:14:58.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好运 洛奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck, Rocky.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.82,1:15:01.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢了 斯拜德 我很感激\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, Spider. Appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.20,1:15:15.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没人指望什么  我想 已经过了青春颠峰期的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody's expecting much, I think, from the way-past-his-prime...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.64,1:15:17.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...前冠军 洛奇·巴尔博亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...former champ, Rocky Balboa.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.21,1:15:21.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛克 我想跟你谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rock, I gotta talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.25,1:15:28.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看 我知道你有很多要发泄出来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I know you got a lot of stuff you gotta get out of your system.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.99,1:15:33.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚就这么做 好吗? 摆脱那tm野兽...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tonight you do it. Right? Get rid of the damn beast...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.72,1:15:38.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...让那结束吧 一劳永逸 求你了 我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...let it be done, once and for all. Please, I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.46,1:15:43.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇! 洛奇! 洛奇!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky! Rocky! Rocky!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.90,1:15:52.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,灯光亮了 嗡嗡声逐渐变成了咆哮声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There go the lights. The buzz is building toward a roaring crescendo.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.22,1:16:10.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是谁唱的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did that come from?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.59,1:16:13.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我告诉你 我爱辛纳屈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you. I love Sinatra.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.26,1:16:16.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他非常好 辛纳屈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's very good, Sinatra.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.47,1:16:19.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们走 - 很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's go. - Very good.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.74,1:16:26.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇·巴尔博亚来了 战场上的退伍老兵...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And here comes Rocky Balboa, veteran of the wars...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.44,1:16:29.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...我们最后再为他来一次欢呼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...here for one more last hurrah.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.28,1:16:32.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没准是最后的晚餐吧 他就是主菜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or the Last Supper, perhaps, with him as the main course.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.38,1:16:35.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么音乐? 你开玩笑呢吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that music? You can't be serious.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.19,1:16:37.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"厚望"? 讲的是祝愿的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"High Hopes"? Talk about wishful thinking.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.12,1:16:41.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呵呵 也许没希望更加实际吧 但无论如何 人们挺喜欢的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, maybe no hopes is more realistic. Anyway, the crowd likes it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.43,1:16:45.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快看那意大利种马 冷静又放松\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at the Italian Stallion. Cool and relaxed.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.80,1:16:49.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇是个注定了的失败者 所以他们根本不在乎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky's an off-the-board underdog, and they don't care at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.70,1:16:53.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是关于他的骄傲 尊严和他的拳头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is about his pride and dignity and his punch, guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.70,1:16:56.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后引以为傲的就是这家伙的拳头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The last thing to go is a guy's punch.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.41,1:16:59.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇总是有着一个拳手的运气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky always has that puncher's chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.21,1:17:08.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇·巴尔博亚仍然是 就像你听到的 人们的拳王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky Balboa is still, as you can hear, the people's champion.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.49,1:17:10.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,预测 伙计们: 至少在前两回合...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prediction, guys: For at least two rounds...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.09,1:17:12.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...迪克逊得忙下了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Dixon's gonna have his hands full.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.99,1:17:17.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,满两个回合? 房子里有个傻的乐观主义者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two whole rounds? We have a cockeyed optimist in the house.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.99,1:17:19.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你好吗? - 人们想看些...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How you doing? - The crowd wants to see...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.00,1:17:21.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...真的 或者至少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...something real, or at least...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.83,1:17:23.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇·巴尔博亚刚刚问我好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky Balboa just asked me how I'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.03,1:17:28.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从小看这家伙比赛长大 从未想过能为他解说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I grew up watching this guy. I never thought I'd be calling one of his fights.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.21,1:17:31.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这真是难以置信 我是他的拳迷 受不了了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is unbelievable. I'm a fan, I can't help it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.08,1:17:34.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,梅森·迪克逊出场了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now here comes Mason Dixon.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.95,1:18:11.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,梅森·迪克逊出现在拳击台上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mason Dixon establishing his presence in the ring.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.58,1:18:15.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,突然场边出现了对话场面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And suddenly now a conversation breaking out at ringside.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.52,1:18:18.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迈克·泰森大叫 梅森·"分界线"·迪克逊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mike Tyson calling out Mason "The Line" Dixon.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.42,1:18:20.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你要掌握比赛 - 我是冠军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You can't call no shots here. - I'm the champ.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.12,1:18:23.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能无为 这是慈善工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You not doing nothing. This is charity work.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.66,1:18:26.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你和那侏儒一起比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got that midget with you right there.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.43,1:18:34.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女士们 先生们 欢迎来到曼德勒海湾渡...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ladies and gentlemen, welcome to the Mandalay Bay...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.54,1:18:39.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...拉斯维加斯的娱乐场和圣地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...resort and casino of Las Vegas.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.24,1:18:42.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚的大事件...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And a special main event of the evening...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.88,1:18:46.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...10局令人兴奋的比赛...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...10 rounds of heavyweight excitement...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.35,1:18:48.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...通过内华达州竞技协会批准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...sanctioned by the Nevada State Athletic Commission.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.95,1:18:52.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当铃声响起 比赛将由裁判乔·科特斯掌控\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And when the bell rings, the referee in charge of the action, Joe Cortez.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.59,1:18:57.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在 数千记的观众...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now, for the thousands in attendance...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.89,1:19:03.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...数百万的电视观众 女士们 先生们...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and the millions watching around the world, ladies and gentlemen...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.80,1:19:09.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...比赛要开始了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...let's get ready to rumble!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.77,1:19:14.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先介绍的是 蓝角的是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Introducing first, fighting out of the blue corner...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.11,1:19:19.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...穿着黑色和金色相间的 官方体重 2 1 7 磅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...wearing black with gold, official weight, 217 pounds.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.98,1:19:24.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的职业生涯记录 57胜 54次击倒获胜...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His professional record, 57 victories including 54 knockouts...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.79,1:19:27.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,... 23败 和 1平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...with 23 defeats and one draw.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.99,1:19:31.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是费城的拳击骄傲...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is the fighting pride of Philadelphia...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.43,1:19:35.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...两界世界重量级冠军...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the two-time heavyweight champion of the world...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.97,1:19:38.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,..."意大利种马"...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..."The Italian Stallion"...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.23,1:19:42.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...洛奇...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Rocky...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.01,1:19:45.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...巴尔博亚!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Balboa!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.41,1:19:50.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望他脑袋被打暴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hope he gets his head busted.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.05,1:19:53.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.75,1:19:59.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拳击台另一边的是 红角的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Across the ring, fighting out of the red corner...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.72,1:20:03.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...蓝黑相间 官方体重 221磅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...wearing white with blue, official weight, 221 pounds.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.76,1:20:08.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他有着完美的职业生涯记录 33场比赛...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He has a perfect professional record, consisting of 33 bouts...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.93,1:20:12.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...33 胜 有 30 击倒获胜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...33 victories, including 30 knockouts.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.37,1:20:14.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原籍佛罗里达的坦帕...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Originally from Tampa, Florida...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.50,1:20:17.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...但代表了内华达的拉斯维加斯...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but now fighting out of Las Vegas, Nevada...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.71,1:20:22.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...本界的无可置疑的 不可击败的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the reigning undisputed, undefeated...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.21,1:20:25.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...世界重量级冠军...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...heavyweight champion of the world...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.35,1:20:28.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...梅森·"分界线"...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Mason "The Line"...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.02,1:20:32.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...迪克逊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Dixon!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.13,1:20:38.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.96,1:20:42.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在 梅森 洛奇 比赛前再讲下规则\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, Mason, Rocky. We went over the rules in the dressing room.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.50,1:20:46.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是个公平干净的比赛 小心 肾部拳 打后脑勺...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I expect a good, clean fight. Watch the kidney punches, rabbit punches...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.70,1:20:49.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...打下盘 当心 表现出运动员的职业精神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...low blows, be careful with those. Give me good sportsmanlike conduct.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.07,1:20:53.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记住 先生们 我很公平 但我很严格 握手!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember, gentlemen, I'm fair but I'm firm. Touch them up!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.94,1:20:56.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 比赛愉快 - 冠军状态不是最好...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Enjoy the ride. - The champ is not in the best shape...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.68,1:20:59.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...我们拭目以待吧 也许他想快点结束回家吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...we've seen him in. Maybe he plans to phone this in and go home early.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.15,1:21:02.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这也不会令人惊奇 - 真高兴你来陪我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That wouldn't be a surprise. - Glad you could make it.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.75,1:21:05.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有一件事我们确定的关于洛奇的:\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One thing about Rocky we know for sure:
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.56,1:21:07.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起来状态不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This guy's showing up in shape.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.96,1:21:10.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 老家伙疯了 - 他将要疯了 他在这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The old man's crazy. - He's gotta be crazy. He's in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.96,1:21:12.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 放松 就是个表演赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay. - Take it easy. This is an exhibition.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.06,1:21:14.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行吗? 找他去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right? Do it to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.70,1:21:17.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有3局来设定节奏 每次你打到他 都要对他造成影响\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got three rounds to set a pace. Every time you hit him, make a dent.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.07,1:21:20.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 知道了 - 洛奇·巴尔博亚比赛前...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Got it. - The moments before...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.20,1:21:23.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...的时刻? 我真不敢相信就在这儿!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...a Rocky Balboa fight? I can't believe it's here!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.84,1:21:26.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第1局开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Round one begins.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.24,1:21:29.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果老乔治·弗尔曼用一拳震惊了世界...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If old George Foreman shocked the world with one punch...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.11,1:21:32.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...老洛奇·巴尔博亚为什么不能?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...why can't old Rocky Balboa?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.42,1:21:34.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竞技场上既有刺激...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And as much excitement as there is in the arena...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.92,1:21:37.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...令人感到不祥的预感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...there's a sense of foreboding as well.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.62,1:21:45.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在 梅森·"分界线"·迪克逊 开始了他的拿手痛戳 就仿佛...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now, Mason "The Line" Dixon goes to work with his jab as though...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.46,1:21:49.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...他在与世界一级的挑战者比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...he's fighting against the number one challenger in the heavyweight division.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.77,1:21:51.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看 这比预期的早了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, this is to be expected early on.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.83,1:21:54.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道冠军会用他的痛戳保持距离...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You knew the champ would control the distance with his jab...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.70,1:21:56.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...他的高度 他的击打范围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...his height, his range.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.11,1:22:01.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴尔博亚找机会打了一拳 太歪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Balboa looking to get in a shot, misses wildly.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.38,1:22:03.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你喜欢这吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you like that?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.68,1:22:06.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起来是速度袋与普通沙袋的比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It looks like a speed bag against a punching bag.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.02,1:22:08.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇的击空很好理解...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky's understandably frustrated...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.79,1:22:11.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...他退休了又来参加比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but he came out of retirement to get into a fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.29,1:22:13.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,象洛奇这样的人不喜欢被人当做玩具耍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys named Rocky don't like to be toyed with.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.02,1:22:15.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一拳仍可以扭转比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One punch could still turn it around.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.93,1:22:19.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,显然他已经忘记了吃今早关节炎药了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apparently he forgot his arthritis meds this morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.33,1:22:20.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇又没打着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky misses.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.16,1:22:24.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一颗由冠军发射的肉追踪导弹打中了下颚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a meat-seeking missile on the point of the chin by the champ.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.07,1:22:27.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 迪克逊的更精确的痛戳 - 洛奇!洛奇! 洛奇!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- More pinpoint jabs by Dixon. - Rocky! Rocky! Rocky!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.97,1:22:31.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个巴尔博亚的右重拳 又一个左拳 又一个右拳!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And there's a hard right hand and a left and a right by Balboa!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.47,1:22:34.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他用一组合拳把迪克逊打到了边上!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He drives Dixon into the ropes with a series of shots!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.61,1:22:37.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人群沸腾了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the crowd goes berserk!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.88,1:22:46.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪克逊惩罚了巴尔博亚刚才的重拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dixon punishing Balboa for the temerity of landing those shots.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.66,1:22:54.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是在角落的进入实战的距离 巴尔博亚和迪克逊就这么打着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's toe to toe in the corner. Balboa and Dixon letting it all go.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.00,1:23:03.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴尔博亚实施了对冠军头部的有效打击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Balboa landing potent combinations to the head of the champion.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.21,1:23:05.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对迪克逊的唤醒召唤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A wake-up call for Dixon.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.61,1:23:07.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你怎么样? - 恩 我还不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You all right? - Yeah, I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.41,1:23:10.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这家伙手套象是有砖头 - 你地下室的东西那?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The man's got bricks in his gloves. - Where's the stuff in the basement?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.78,1:23:12.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 还在 - 让他去战斗 好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's still there. - He came to battle, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.15,1:23:14.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 试着把我打倒 - 听者  听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Trying to knock me out. - Listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.78,1:23:17.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,假如有一块骨头他能打断 他就会去打断\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If there's a bone he can break, he's gonna do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.39,1:23:19.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 对他表示尊重 - 那谁来尊重我?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Give the man respect. - What about my respect?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.86,1:23:22.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,CompuBox电脑数字显示了个令人毛骨悚然的记录\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}CompuBox numbers tell the grisly story here.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.86,1:23:25.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴尔博亚在那轮实施13次打击9中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Balboa landed nine of 13 punches in that round.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.10,1:23:31.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪克逊有令人难以置信的69中59\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dixon landed an incredible 59 out of 69.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.43,1:23:34.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 为什么你不听我说? - 洛奇到过这儿上百万次了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why don't you listen to me? - Rocky's been here a million times.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.07,1:23:38.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在上一局被打后 他又迎来了新的一局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coming out to start a round after he took a beating in the previous one.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.44,1:23:41.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 记住我说的 好吗? - 我警告他了 我警告他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Remember what I said, okay? - I warned him. I warned him.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.68,1:23:47.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他累了 他的腿很快 或已经不听使唤了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's tired. His legs are going fast, or already gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.78,1:23:52.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇还能受的了真是难以置信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what's truly extraordinary is that Rocky can still take it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.52,1:23:57.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,批准了执照的拳击委员会...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The boxing commission, which was criticized for licensing him...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.63,1:24:01.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...没准儿会被屠杀 假如洛奇发生了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...would be massacred if something happened to Rocky.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.17,1:24:07.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个恐怖的左直拳! 洛奇摔倒了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And a monstrous straight left hand! Down goes Rocky!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.04,1:24:10.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这大概就是比赛的结束了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that could conceivably be the end of the fight!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.51,1:24:14.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这大概就是表演赛了 但是 不 巴尔博亚站起来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That could be the exhibition right there. But no. Balboa up.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.51,1:24:18.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裁判乔·科特斯问他是否要继续 洛奇说是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Referee Joe Cortez asks if he wants to continue, and Rocky says yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.98,1:24:21.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算是洛奇·巴尔博亚 这也太'勇敢了'吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even Rocky Balboa could be too brave for his own good.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.02,1:24:25.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪克逊过来试着结束比赛 巴尔博亚差点摔倒!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dixon comes right back to try to finish it. Balboa almost went down!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.79,1:24:27.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇竟然把迪克逊向后推\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky actually shoves Dixon back.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.96,1:24:30.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪克逊实施了野兽般的打击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As Dixon lands these brutal shots.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.66,1:24:33.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 防住! 防住! - 近距离的无顾忌打击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Cover up! Cover up! - Open shots at close range.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.40,1:24:35.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,右  左 巴尔博亚倒下了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right and left hands, and down goes Balboa!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.10,1:24:39.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许是他职业生涯的最后一次了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps for the last time in his fighting career!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.64,1:24:42.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 确实该是了 - 3! 4!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That should do it. - Three! Four!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.20,1:24:44.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,5! 6!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five! Six!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.71,1:24:46.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 起来! 起来! - 7!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get up! Get up! - Seven!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.51,1:24:48.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,8! 9!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eight! Nine!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.75,1:24:52.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你感觉怎么样 兄弟? 你还好吧? - 洛奇极其兴奋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How do you feel, man? You okay? - Now Rocky is furious with himself.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.12,1:24:55.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他告诉科特斯他想继续比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He convinces Cortez he wants to keep fighting.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.89,1:24:57.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪克逊告诉裁判结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dixon's pointing at the ref to end it.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.92,1:25:00.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇挥着手说他没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky waving his arms and saying he's fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.19,1:25:02.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他想继续! - 打啊! 打啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He wants to go on! - Let it go! Let it go!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.29,1:25:06.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴尔博亚回来了! 一个左拳 一个右拳...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Balboa comes back! With a left and a right...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.53,1:25:10.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...第2次逼迪克逊到绳子边!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and bulls Dixon into the ropes for the second round in a row!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.63,1:25:14.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪克逊用野兽般的左直拳还击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back comes Dixon with brutal left-hand shots.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.37,1:25:16.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 迪克逊伤了他的手! - 追上他!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dixon hurt his hand there! - Go after him!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.74,1:25:18.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是洛奇的最好机会!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Rocky's best chance!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.57,1:25:20.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冠军打洛奇的屁股时明显伤了手!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The champ obviously hurt his hand on Rocky's hip!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.98,1:25:24.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴尔博亚立刻对他进行了攻击! 强大的右勾拳!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Balboa immediately going to work to the body! Huge right hook!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.98,1:25:28.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴尔博亚对的迪克逊身体进行猛烈的进攻! 都是重拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Balboa ripping away at Dixon's body! These are big punches.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.78,1:25:32.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇! 洛奇! 洛奇!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky! Rocky! Rocky!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.92,1:25:34.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.43,1:25:41.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇·巴尔博亚打倒了当今的重量级拳王!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky Balboa has knocked the reigning heavyweight champion down!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.06,1:25:43.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你打伤他了! - 梅森·"分界线"·迪克逊...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You hurt him! - Mason "The Line" Dixon...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.13,1:25:46.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...从没收到过这么多的还击...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...has never taken this kind of punishment...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.37,1:25:48.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...在他的整个职业生涯!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...in his entire professional career!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.70,1:25:52.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大概他在使自己清醒 但那些重拳真的打倒了肋骨上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe he's clearing his head, but the body shots really caved in his ribs.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.88,1:25:55.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴尔博亚在想击倒他!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Balboa is thinking knockout himself!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.71,1:25:59.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴尔博亚另一个反击勾拳 又两个!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Another counterhook by Balboa, followed by two more!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.42,1:26:01.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪克逊用自己的勾拳反击! 现在洛奇晕了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dixon fires back his own hooks! Now Rocky's stunned.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.08,1:26:04.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一直在绳边打...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's an all-out war along the ropes...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.79,1:26:09.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...第2局快完了 在场中巨大的混乱!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...as round two comes to a close amid a giant tumult in the ring!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.53,1:26:12.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难以置信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.29,1:26:13.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.13,1:26:15.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎来到洛奇的地盘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to Rockyland.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.04,1:26:22.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 手怎么样? - 我的手断了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How's the hand? - My hand's broken.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.57,1:26:26.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们败了 那就怪你! 你!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We lose, it's your ass! Your ass!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.78,1:26:29.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,几秒后就会失去知觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It will numb up on you in a few rounds.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.25,1:26:32.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一旦开始麻木了 迪克逊就会有很难用拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once that hand numbs up, Dixon will be able to throw it hard.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.02,1:26:35.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那时 洛奇机会就到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until then, here is Rocky's chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.58,1:26:38.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 别转身! - 忍住疼 冠军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No reverse! - Take the pain, champ.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.49,1:26:41.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坚持住! 每个人都认为是个笑话 包括我!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay on him! Everybody thought this was a joke, including me!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.46,1:26:44.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在没有人笑你了! 坚持住! 去扁他!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now nobody's laughing! Stay on him! You go get him!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.86,1:26:46.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用力揍他!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go out strong!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.57,1:26:59.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让他离你远些!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep him off you!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.45,1:27:04.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就那样! 就那样!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it! That's it!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.89,1:27:20.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你那局赢了 打垮他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won that round. Break him down.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.64,1:27:28.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,炸他! 炸他!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bomb him! Bomb him!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.34,1:27:35.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.48,1:27:41.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不停向他们扔炸弹!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just keep throwing them bombs!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.56,1:27:54.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.27,1:28:04.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能行的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.21,1:28:07.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛克 洛克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocko. Rocko.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.59,1:28:18.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油 上!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, come on, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.01,1:29:17.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,越过他! 压扁他!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go through him! Run over him!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.33,1:29:34.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在他身上发泄!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unload on him!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.43,1:29:37.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下面 梅森!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get down, Mason!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.25,1:29:51.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们都用尽全力 兄弟们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're leaving nothing on the table, guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.45,1:29:55.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,观众还站着 大概下周他们也不会坐下了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fans are still standing. They may not be able to sit down for a week.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.12,1:29:58.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他做得太伟大了! - 我做得比我想像得要好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're doing great! - I'm doing better than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.05,1:30:02.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你确定他没事? - 更坏得我都受过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You sure he's okay? - I've had worse.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.03,1:30:06.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,近距离对战 还有一局 谁能相信这是真的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toe to toe, one round to go. Who would've believed this was possible?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.93,1:30:09.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你还能看见吗? - 让我跟他说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can you see out of that eye? - Let me talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.70,1:30:11.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别花太大的力气了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't take any more chances than you have to.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.90,1:30:14.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么可证明的了 爸 没什么可证明的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nothing more to prove, Pop. There's nothing more to prove.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.04,1:30:17.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我必须走完我要走的路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta go out the way I gotta go out.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.34,1:30:18.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能行的 洛克!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can do it, Rocko!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.11,1:30:21.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 还有1局 我们回家 - 好的 那就做吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- One more round, we go home. - Okay, then do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.58,1:30:25.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有句老话说每个伟大冠军...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's an old saying that every great champion has...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.28,1:30:30.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...都有场精彩的比赛 而洛奇 正在带来他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...one great fight left in him, and Rocky is proving it so far.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.75,1:30:33.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 来 握个手 - 洛克! 你人生中最后一场比赛!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on. Touch them up. - Rocko! The last round of your life!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.12,1:30:35.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 来, - 最后1局!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on, guys. - The last round!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.96,1:30:38.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来 握个手 来 握个手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Touch them up, let's go. Touch them up.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.99,1:30:41.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你是个疯狂的老人 - 你会体验到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You are one crazy old man. - You'll get there.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.36,1:30:43.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.83,1:30:47.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,10制的第10局 谁能想到...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tenth round of a scheduled 10. Who would ever have dreamed...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.24,1:30:52.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...洛奇·巴尔博亚还在"表演赛"与...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that Rocky Balboa would still be in this quote, "exhibition," against...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.21,1:30:54.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- ...重量级冠军? - 你能行的!加油!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...the heavyweight champion? - You can do it! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.14,1:30:59.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这场比赛好像是在给迪克逊上勇气的职业培训课\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This fight is as though Dixon got on-the-job training in courage.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.58,1:31:03.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 防住! 防住! - 他们都感觉不到疼了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Cover up! Cover up! - They're both in a pain-free zone!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.52,1:31:06.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这俩家伙在另一维比赛!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These guys are fighting in another dimension right now!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.92,1:31:10.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超越信念! 巴尔博亚照直冲向了迪克逊的拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beyond belief! Balboa just walking straight into Dixon's punches.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.16,1:31:13.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪克逊的击打目标练习\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Target practice for Dixon.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.20,1:31:19.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们在交换右勾拳! 巴尔博亚抖了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're exchanging right hooks! Balboa's drilled!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.84,1:31:23.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪克逊的拳来了! 他因为打他已经筋疲力尽了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here comes Dixon! He's exhausted from just punching the man!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.94,1:31:26.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把这孙子打倒 小梅!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Knock this bum out, Mase!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.82,1:31:42.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你对你孩子说得是什么? 不是你能打得多狠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it you said to the kid? It ain't about how hard you hit.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.03,1:31:47.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而是你能承受得了重击 然后一直向前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's about how hard you can get hit and keep moving forward.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.36,1:31:51.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能承受 一直向前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much you can take and keep moving forward.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.23,1:31:53.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 洛奇! 洛奇! 洛奇! - 起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Rocky! Rocky! Rocky! - Get up.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.20,1:31:55.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 加油! 起来! - 洛奇! 洛奇! 洛奇!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's go! Get up! - Rocky! Rocky! Rocky!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.40,1:31:58.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇!洛奇! 洛奇!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky! Rocky! Rocky!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.34,1:32:00.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get up.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.30,1:32:24.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又一个猛兽般得重击 洛奇的老祖宗都能感受到这拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Another monster body shot. Rocky's ancestors must have felt that one.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.07,1:32:27.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油 洛奇! 用自己的手!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Rocky! Start moving those hands!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.37,1:32:29.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不到2分钟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Less than two minutes to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.24,1:32:31.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人群都很惊讶巴尔博亚能起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The crowd is astonished that Balboa got up.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.77,1:32:34.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 加油! - 打他! 一条龙的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on! - Turn it over! All the way through!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.71,1:32:36.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,报复十分疯狂!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And retaliates with fury!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.95,1:32:41.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打扁他!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chop him down!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.82,1:32:46.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油 洛奇! 加油!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Rocky! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.92,1:32:50.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收拾他现在!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take him out now!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.63,1:32:53.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们又开始对拳了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're trading shots again!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.86,1:32:57.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴尔博亚不分什么的乱打!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Balboa is trying to hit anything and anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.80,1:33:01.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赢! 赢!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Win it! Win it!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.28,1:33:10.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.88,1:33:11.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.56,1:33:23.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是个伟大的冠军 挺伟大的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a great champion. You got heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.56,1:33:25.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢这次机会 好人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks for the opportunity. Good man.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.36,1:33:31.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这真难以置信 这是我见过最伟大的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was unbelievable. That was the greatest thing I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.60,1:33:36.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你成功了 这就是你一直说的比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did it. That's the kind of fighting you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.91,1:33:39.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Paulie.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.08,1:33:42.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,野兽走了 野兽出去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That beast is gone now. The beast is out.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.08,1:33:46.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,体育中被用的最为过度的就是 伙计们 是"难以置信"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of the most overused words in sports, guys, is "incredible."
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.05,1:33:51.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我讨厌这么说 这真是难以置信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hate to say it. This is incredible.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.72,1:33:54.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们走!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.13,1:34:00.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女士们 先生们 在我们看记分牌前...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ladies and gentlemen, before we go to the scorecards...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.96,1:34:07.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...让我们为俩位勇士欢呼吧!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...a round of applause for these two heavyweight warriors!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.71,1:34:15.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们有个分歧判定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have a split decision.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.35,1:34:23.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本·科劳斯 给95-94...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Adelaide Byrd scores it 95-94...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.39,1:34:25.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...迪克逊赢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Dixon.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.49,1:34:30.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔可·杰伯 给 95-94...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chuck Giampa has it 95-94...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.06,1:34:33.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,..巴尔博亚赢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Balboa.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.20,1:34:45.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比尔·可汉姆 给 95-94...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Bill Graham scores it 95-94...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.24,1:34:50.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...分歧判定的胜者 仍然是难以致胜的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...for the winner by split decision, and still undefeated...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.58,1:34:53.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...世界重量级冠军...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the heavyweight champion of the world...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.62,1:34:59.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...梅森·"分界线"·迪克逊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Mason "The Line" Dixon!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.72,1:35:04.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇! 洛奇! 洛奇!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky! Rocky! Rocky!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.38,1:35:59.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道 没有你我什么也干不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I couldn't have done nothing without you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.82,1:36:04.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾德里安 我们成功了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo, Adrian, we did it.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.16,1:36:12.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们成功了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We did it.
